227	3	17	The evolving nature of work necessitates continuous\ntraining and reassessment of occupation al safety frameworks\nto equip workers with the skills needed to navigate automated\nsystems effectively. The challenge of managing risks introduced by automation is\nfurther compounded by the need for robust safety\nmechanisms. The reliance on automated machi ne guarding\nsystems underscores the importance of implementing\nprotective measures from the onset of automation processes. Similarly, advancements in tools like Safety Integrity Levels\n(SIL) and real -time monitoring systems have been pivotal in\nmitigating risks but require a high degree of precision and\nconstant oversight to maintain efficacy.	1. Introduction	99	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.056136377,-0.0027487802,-0.059054893,-0.013443695,0.048816618,0.008917367,0.07054307,0.00034572495,-0.06589863,0.027747165,0.039868765,-0.03188451,0.057690702,0.058186118,-0.10176222,-0.07141005,0.050812464,-0.08517119,-0.07475508,-0.012523592,0.025831858,0.031747155,-0.030490905,0.06638342,-0.1368879,-0.0392999,-0.012396601,-0.027623888,-0.003472154,-0.013864919,-0.027265424,-0.07023334,0.04842052,-0.02405208,0.010755546,-0.07933005,0.034821816,0.024690976,0.027942168,-0.08323514,-0.05817961,-0.09014924,-0.009025025,0.009531912,-0.016237658,0.022581683,0.017591946,-0.10268811,0.030621056,0.0051792455,-0.101617716,0.017132495,0.11314453,-0.0037907045,0.045040313,0.031705886,0.066078566,-0.00502151,-0.034243617,0.0040072678,0.00121803,0.0032523028,-0.08442482,-0.005828073,0.0033050454,0.07145292,-0.098800726,-0.03054009,0.05855393,0.10652535,-0.073322855,-0.041267198,-0.018020492,0.04263121,0.047038395,0.029809797,-0.065454476,-0.08267552,0.011892573,-0.04821322,-0.034850642,-0.002279319,0.038806833,0.11114744,0.034322962,0.0640854,-0.042290498,0.022431374,0.11532725,-0.014122865,0.00034707898,-0.06546438,0.05237076,-0.008297176,0.07144517,-0.053752635,0.002214235,0.010197219,-0.035686366,-0.01532563,0.010309269,-0.06654232,-0.06500