220	3	10	This\nwill ensure that automation is harnessed not only as a tool for\noperational efficiency but also as a cornerstone for advancing\nworker safety and well -being in energy industries. The objectives of this review are aligned with the overarching\ngoal of fostering innovation while maintaining rigorous\nsafety standards. By exploring the interplay between\nautomation and worker safety, the review aims to bridge the\ngap between technological advancement and practical\nimplementation in real -world scenarios. This alignment is\ncritical in ensuring that automation continues to serve as a\ndriving force for progress in the energy sector while\nsafeguarding human lives and p romoting sustainable\npractices.\n1.3. Clarification of the review’s aims and scope, focusing\non evaluating the safety benefits of automation while\naddressing potential risks and their mitigation\nAutomation has become an integral part of modern industries\nand systems, promising unparalleled benefits in efficiency\nand safety.	1. Introduction	146	5	\N	\N	{}	[-0.08123676,0.042896613,-0.010310277,0.0025721143,0.0699129,0.029563215,0.0068913805,0.042976905,-0.101983674,-0.0015963599,0.007279949,-0.038945638,0.060362983,-0.031289294,-0.022786317,-0.009515661,0.040544424,-0.08357318,-0.06280672,-0.03034197,0.036620066,0.016235998,0.05767188,0.027505137,-0.06963457,0.057423893,0.022387192,-0.004972952,-0.08753932,0.06640332,-0.0735268,-0.124772795,0.024725564,-0.013808395,0.04459937,-0.009003239,0.026898963,0.027668523,0.09668095,-0.10733372,-0.03411943,-0.17997175,-0.06952255,-0.031957585,-0.03283848,0.068055734,-0.022969624,-0.13781537,-0.013883981,-0.09106229,-0.039932515,0.005420357,0.091106415,-0.036354452,0.011197617,-0.022073077,0.07797144,-0.03706146,-0.0016143854,0.01896217,0.048022658,-0.060726423,-0.017191676,0.013922262,0.06212276,0.023453878,-0.053771064,-0.020417497,0.012836182,0.021312341,-0.03486916,-0.02848853,0.03982849,-0.052061193,0.0087463735,-0.03393363,-0.014887688,-