283	3	73	Fail-safe sys tems are another critical component of effective\nautomation strategies. These systems are designed to\nmaintain safety even in the event of equipment failure or\nhuman error. By integrating multiple layers of safety\ncontrols, fail -safe mechanisms ensure that operations remain\nwithin acceptable limits, preventing catastrophic incidents.	2. Literature Review	48	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.016006934,-0.018868402,-0.044270206,-0.010546684,0.047085065,-0.030892534,0.07189039,0.10248882,-0.020217542,0.122616135,0.076097056,-0.006820668,0.10491357,0.0012195165,0.0064478316,-0.02843288,0.029587358,-0.069598235,0.008746814,-0.028638205,-0.047949582,0.029860608,-0.059729226,0.06046594,-0.20412643,-0.03830213,-0.02493417,-0.007878458,-0.02677378,-0.031042391,-0.028368263,-0.056473088,-0.07051658,0.007815529,-0.030192059,-0.0069611976,0.0035575503,-0.03556322,0.001703655,-0.08738664,-0.0813744,-0.0905826,-0.06213446,-0.013580749,-0.022014901,0.04370058,0.01477852,-0.06812958,-0.013090189,-0.036332674,-0.050558183,0.029943515,0.082311094,0.037279345,0.0057960725,0.019556478,0.09076925,0.010982354,-0.09225122,-0.009907326,0.032940168,-0.005168787,-0.051779654,0.020187203,0.05876072,0.07817632,-0.02179613,-0.023918785,0.032110654,0.07678422,-0.045687668,-0.059531692,0.0049918857,0.10437807,0.008692486,-0.010772932,-0.038449977,-0.07166029,0.009356291,0.024369515,-0.01584598,-0.028448552,-0.017734084,0.039358087,0.045331426,0.026043288,-0.033698834,0.012744918,0.09622103,-0.008542284,0.042678956,-0.012825483,0.11801286,0.048730243,0.09271594,-0.0077987732,-0.018404331,-0.021716617,0.017927906,-0.08535454,-0.0007320237,-0.00035656453,-0.03775489,0.014264792,0.04037986,0.000111382236,-0.032007243,-0.020375645,0.062660985,-0.011244042,0.0020417871,0.0086493855,0.04353135,-0.040216275,-0.0031353475,-0.023250464,-0.087150775,-0.015969599,0.021605436,0.014375294,0.021096783,-0.0118688075,0.039009735,0.0018280804,0.12817205,0.014466981,0.03469615,2.0367833e-33,-0.009629038,0.