309	4	4	Human experts should\nInformation 2024 ,15, 728. https://doi.org/10.3390/info15110728 https://www.mdpi.com/journal/information\nInformation 2024 ,15, 728 2 of 42\nnot be replaced but integrated into the loop so that humans and systems can collaborate\ndynamically to mitigate each other’s limitations and enhance each other’s strengths. There-\nfore, the current trend in Industry 5.0 is collaboration and cooperation between humans\nand intelligent systems to achieve optimal performance. This approach is not novel but,\nas Sendhoff and Wersing (2020) have noted in their work ’Cooperative Intelligence—A\nHumane Perspective’ [ 2], a ’human-centric’ view of AI-based systems that has recently\nbeen taken to the forefront.	1. Introduction	99	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.048426405,0.024234492,-0.041098196,-0.027967894,0.0082056355,-0.015570092,0.029798863,-0.034690246,-0.034471143,0.008599578,-0.06692664,0.09618804,-0.001021827,0.018262664,-0.038171735,-0.0032441332,0.0066693076,-0.109452195,-0.058174267,-0.059501898,-0.035306524,-0.012506703,-0.023212608,-0.004188847,-0.05299822,0.016283164,-0.0036380491,-0.080141105,-0.074584864,-0.04464651,0.0053494032,-0.023778649,0.082187414,-0.015289503,-0.09119334,0.07221319,0.05249698,-0.002680702,0.10266208,-0.045310922,-0.042100277,-0.08557988,-0.06882077,0.017130615,-0.024164293,0.03831613,-0.07198196,-0.07593753,-0.004802042,-0.032815624,-0.17816706,-0.010744337,0.0828878,-0.020784052,0.005845163,0.016418094,-0.017363356,-0.006191931,-0.011488337,-0.045353767,0.05583403,-0.06151791,0.048331216,0.038801104,0.049149472,0.037416827,0.0105983475,0.0005138999,-0.08967707,-0.045653068,0.029874112,-0.0013138491,-0.012004685,-0.044501476,0.045262504,0.0031022117,-0.014193063,-0.0857041,0.07229537,-0.09146467,-0.02578987,0.008526017,-0.041237626,0.03639571,-0.040476937,-0.04067501,-0.07238216,0.0194683,0.07782406,-0.050562136,-0.08784485,-0.06440206,-0.013223776,0.0077482536,0.054228626,0.08460642,-0.05508863,0.057793986,-0.059772782,0.03574088