337	4	32	These works contribute with innovative technology that aims to achieve one of the goals of\nIndustry 5.0: seamless and safe human–machine interaction and collaboration to capitalize\non the human worker’s added value and the efficiency of advanced robotic solutions. For\nsafe collaboration, earlier work defined Human Occupancy Volumes (HOVs) to constrain\nthe path search space and compute the collision probability between human and robot [ 37],\nwhile more recent systems aimed at dynamic real-time collision avoidance using vision\nsystems or models for human motion prediction [ 40,42,46,48]. For autonomous/semi-\nautonomous driving, of either teleoperated mobile robots [ 38,45] or vehicles [ 44], the goal\nof collaboration is instead the incorporation of the driver’s intention/preference in the\ngenerated paths, while assisting the driver with automated path generation, compliance\nwith safety constraints, and the monitoring of environmental obstacles.	3. Results	136	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.0054593133,-0.010971287,-0.028399924,0.014157595,0.06542452,-0.0702905,0.008175509,0.01145453,-0.029551849,0.013261503,0.0064103873,-0.01701425,0.027297156,0.029533602,-0.03391352,0.003935331,0.031896546,-0.010662665,-0.08613745,0.015863769,0.0013382231,0.05246692,0.017460177,-0.008406565,-0.055661213,-0.03837051,0.064278305,-0.026305918,-0.021138847,-0.033217814,0.018145062,-0.060115434,0.068736665,-0.040782716,-0.040350344,-0.004010444,0.02873927,-0.0297612,0.015020283,-0.0575145,-0.05500504,-0.06997717,0.015627004,0.022302128,0.022441315,0.08360298,-0.0072208224,-0.10713682,0.049735334,-0.037178215,-0.07786648,0.00826747,0.043345083,-0.01305567,-0.10123167,0.028588453,-0.04468627,0.003888635,0.04171726,-0.075710565,-0.0019065915,-0.06775026,0.026967091,0.005524411,-0.015168837,-0.04008122,-0.017919067,-0.035775162,0.018525507,0.08915813,-0.010721115,0.045308452,0.010872197,-0.019500418,0.0021043983,0.006063002,0.03527516,-0.028242692,0.037822638,-0.015569366,0.0034816277,-0.05