371	4	66	Tracking can also be employed for task advancement monitoring in real-time [ 66]\nby tracking human motion and comparing the ongoing tracked movements with a task\nreference demonstration, providing an estimate of the task duration. These types of\nsolutions are developed to deal with the variability inherent in human task execution,\nbetween subjects and within the execution by the same subject, which can be a challenge\nfor collaboration and coordination tasks.	3. Results	71	2	\N	\N	{}	[-0.039452225,-0.024348145,-0.06001974,-0.04328617,0.08247663,-0.023446633,0.044675026,-0.022404341,-0.012264511,-0.024005625,0.012032744,-0.03686022,-0.009542947,0.043176275,-0.031770922,-0.088473916,0.108582124,0.02033,-0.027811483,-0.0072296793,0.0036522131,-0.06567796,0.030704334,0.075608715,-0.0704888,0.018109309,-0.03478052,-0.10860961,-0.009450238,-0.0067745787,0.0066745523,-0.01651524,0.096100464,-0.014144629,-0.10102026,0.006525161,-0.0035830473,0.021303214,0.031903204,-0.09207866,-0.057452578,-0.009261305,0.06068378,0.06789467,-0.0044628554,0.06487366,-0.04746289,-0.051931582,-0.061290912,0.06784245,-0.0695845,-0.07386628,0.14606337,-0.04371976,-0.019268215,0.106757335,0.018442776,0.0007986811,0.050556164,-0.011262121,-0.0059988727,-0.05280527,-0.003330518,-0.06643703,-0.012890277,-0.018461175,0.0019425035,0.015835315,0.07140685,0.02107553,-0.077840224,0.06844273,0.009386157,-0.0071369773,-0.05282602,-0.021913579,-0.020230213,-0.07240408,0.023970567,-0.101171196,0.006253198,-0.11585712,-0.010045191,0.032437366,0.08655265,-0.0052015074,-0.00941935,0.08355277,0.027305331,-0.00760877,-0.060079027,-0.031748347,-0.019097425,-0.06835258,-0.0064152293,-0.025822839,-0.009784666,0.08753605,0.07509801,-0.0015648913,0.019296333,-0.025237195,-0.04592206,0.03860199,-0.009110078,0.0068442915,0.050450232,-0.0133471815,0.047182545,-0.019009622,-0.008343165,-0.07536811,-0.024589013,0.011532596,0.07464362,0.022155749,-0.012143698,0.059017718,-0.021945547,-0.0085211955,0.07959235,-0