384	4	79	Human gestures are also useful for more intuitive and efficient robot control and\ninstruction, providing a more ergonomic interaction modality, compared to traditional\nteleoperation systems and controllers. Ref. [ 75] developed a gesture-based human–robot\ninteraction framework that allows the worker to give instructions to a collaborative robot\nfor tools and parts’ delivery, or for holding objects.	3. Results	56	2	\N	\N	{}	[-0.014555529,-0.057155676,0.054550204,-0.10463115,-0.019464998,-0.035102516,0.07607875,0.032636758,-0.0066343434,0.014095666,0.061807867,0.04029063,-0.05944175,0.0020439667,0.106518485,-0.054475494,0.07008303,-0.020478673,-0.045743026,0.06950753,-0.013577206,0.045083076,0.022202382,-0.044583995,-0.086896256,0.017799163,-0.011490851,-0.117645964,0.057941828,0.025363972,-0.046029937,0.011849692,0.074215055,-0.04929118,-0.10889015,0.075439334,0.017115902,0.0031454165,-0.044191625,-0.05166079,-0.08016005,-0.060509276,0.058696706,0.005861002,0.017803809,0.07054898,-0.017276699,-0.035563998,0.07577221,0.039210025,-0.022959035,-0.014555214,0.099151224,-0.061212108,-0.03399708,0.053151164,0.032659616,-0.016392365,0.0072601316,-0.03055499,0.04824759,0.025204906,0.030104432,-0.0021206154,0.014740456,-0.044222634,0.048035435,-0.0845814,-0.003206834,-0.01938329,-0.08558348,-0.028773898,0.029435331,0.052447096,-0.005904094,-0.03137499,0.0016880609,-0.12456976,-0.042589612,-0.013657382,-0.002203238,-0.049389783,-0.00069027167,0.0194161,-0.055629697,0.01844336,0.00040997015,0.04295732,0.020759415,-0.027447928,-0.030434458,-0.03114767,-0.024178237,-0.08022653,-0.095111966,-0.020108009,-0.024895363,0.07000572,-0.063471146,-0.025331682,-0.0059053595,0.02988778,5.130217e-05,-0.02660548,-0.012991389,-0.0063308994,-0.043548368,-0.052781075,0.04278581,0.0012741894,-0.072150186,-0.08389406,-0.086859986,0.027613293,0.020209098,-0.06394364,-0.021217672,-0.0098619135,0.061132547,-0.03581783,0.050019156,-0.013959512,-0.002285851,0.057748556,0.092007026,-0.0438