400	4	95	On the human–robot collaboration domain, ref. [ 98] aimed at recognizing human\nemotion for improved assistance and safety of the human partner. A standard web camera\nwas used to monitor human emotion in real-time, and a transfer learning approach was\nused with a Deep CNN for improved classification accuracy. The highest cross-validation\naccuracy value reached was 97.82%.	3. Results	57	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.061990242,-0.019299464,-0.014965049,-0.044053767,0.066169634,0.025014296,0.036408797,-0.0156245325,-0.015139434,-0.04977009,0.0048098103,-0.03551384,-0.08340386,0.00998577,0.017468851,-0.043711357,0.06615228,0.008963173,-0.029516941,0.049927246,-0.023169521,0.0030811466,-0.0026125368,-0.039056674,-0.017963313,-0.015897974,0.05453008,-0.056046758,0.028188158,-0.019424165,-0.012669548,-0.041126102,0.06138627,0.019014962,-0.058740124,0.08437872,0.01589821,0.013602442,-0.018242324,-0.03957882,-0.06432615,-0.037906032,0.06513526,-0.004932439,-0.0047372594,0.1480615,-0.0042686327,-0.0979885,0.06491229,-0.016456405,-0.06348859,0.049593735,0.03368249,0.094105594,-0.019269453,0.00828507,0.032896902,-0.06657549,0.035498552,-0.013942506,0.0018111201,0.028882278,0.053261686,0.0043503214,-0.04185905,0.01174504,-0.02472068,-0.080140434,0.046842944,-0.035374265,-0.005741998,0.020008273,0.0061089746,-0.044508394,-0.0014844164,0.041864168,0.00750225,-0.022004649,0.07634343,-0.03743463,0.05610236,-0.010923197,0.004433644,-0.011646954,0.084960915,-0.016958667,-0.059204075,0.014054428,-0.10068316,0.030670062,-0.017939385,-0.07011713,0.029082326,-0.066290684,-0.08708716,-0.00066347356,-0.058607645,0.032727636,-0.08847692,0.05797396,-0.01858371,0.019251892,-0.055453252,-0.008214282,0.030887598,-0.00071577035,0.046172384,-0.01458409,0.08962348,-0.025386387,-0.09819666,-0.08226413,-0.093792036,-0.056334574,0.08309048,-0.047072317,-0.06292461,-0.032331593,0.06519353,-0.008332886,-0.006486238,0.0016615923,0.02006792,0.02382595,0.17215504,-0.04853347,-0.053005785,-7.946305e-34,0.07830