437	4	132	Information 2024 ,15, 728 29 of 42\nLanguage-Based Assistance for Navigation\nIn the case of a vision-based navigation scenario, in which a human can request an\nagent to navigate and find a target object indoors, using just high-level language end-goals,\nthe agent can query the human advisor for language sub-goals when it is lost and cannot\nmake progress [ 132]. To implement such a methodology, it is required to learn a navigation\nand help policy to constrain the number of help requests that can be made to the advisor\nand learn at what points it is more effective to make the help requests for the overall\nprogress in the task.	3. Results	110	2	\N	\N	{}	[0.05329968,0.0025639588,0.008345063,-0.05753455,0.01189997,0.043817807,0.068671055,0.031161068,-0.08770839,-0.03343073,-0.02507248,-0.044133086,0.031033296,0.09409613,0.015635336,0.027640784,0.04719028,0.039518073,-0.06794681,-0.03904363,0.044806343,0.035357714,0.070332356,0.0071194884,-0.061444957,0.0047660475,-0.0060044383,-0.13013214,0.04429915,0.0014106865,0.002727405,0.011377241,-0.013493713,0.05972713,0.021252306,0.026947375,-0.054143026,-0.020263601,-0.044780847,-0.012019416,-0.11759295,0.0333875,-0.035385985,0.010951399,0.086180635,0.009896943,-0.025092704,0.011823828,-0.012049153,-0.027155008,-0.16571897,-0.0719194,-0.0019430255,-0.049313713,-0.00916096,0.061151285,-0.008274528,0.040485088,0.018508453,-0.0049626697,0.003160795,-0.080372296,-0.026395075,-0.027897075,0.0050572143,-0.0076866583,-0.027688082,-0.0118459,-0.03480083,0.014337428,-0.053130157,-0.006881047,0.098179035,0.020182539,0.059744928,0.00897896,-0.0023508668,-0.048640005,0.016404577,-0.104771264,0.008109016,0.016773773,-0.005624992,0.05638197,0.073916994,0.003309688,-0.025256906,0.01719986,0.11660357,-0.019439932,-0.0027757569,-0.11737593,0.0027380066,-0.040031493,0.003312579,0.0051883883,-0.024182674,-0.10542053,-0.072756,0.014080926,-0.009199609,-0.031894222,0.060977884,-0.044479974,-0.045563772,-0.027201293,0.076515056,0.081