439	4	134	The method was evaluated on reproducing\nair-drawing motions of letters near a moving human arm, with formal safety verification\nand replanning with a failsafe trajectory to avoid collision, resulting in no safety stops\nobserved for all letters. The trajectories of the robot motion that were replanned to avoid\ncollision still maintained the curvature and shape of the letters since the new trajectory was\nsampled from the probabilistic encoding of the movement. As the method does not need\noptimization or real-time collision checking, it computes in deterministic time; however,\nits validity and effectiveness are dependent on the human model used.	3. Results	99	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.0075068413,-0.056874853,-0.00375067,-0.042122867,-0.019008609,-0.006981717,0.06346864,-0.018056847,0.00039284327,0.09529868,0.10440832,0.03759068,0.046065435,-0.00032229492,-0.07167087,-0.041639533,0.015419686,0.037263535,-0.04852328,0.02181331,-0.0037874016,0.03692493,0.06221163,-0.01410812,-0.02295826,-0.0015176823,0.043818228,-0.038173974,-0.020382876,-0.05025713,0.00081878976,-0.09439126,-0.03846872,-0.037711438,-0.000769034,0.014197876,-0.024858125,0.018704839,-0.03373035,-0.02407619,-0.1202926,-0.04851024,0.031842917,0.036213778,0.12085902,0.11011827,-0.0072059445,0.03754472,-0.023487374,0.10544942,-0.05138653,-0.012738923,0.072158284,-0.020389786,0.009495041,0.017734848,0.004111986,-0.036620066,-1.5605413e-06,-0.07237574,0.0474627,0.008910047,-0.01262597,-0.0066411095,-0.06884354,0.022091758,-0.005465695,-0.08187112,0.06527242,0.0944357,0.0045102546,-0.013647303,-0.01655102,0.04380898,-0.0026804386,-0.016633673,0.040747337,-0.07802281,0.02090372,0.017072985,0.021623684,-0.056069113,-0.015167391,0.061699703,0.013319442,0.11443733,-0.063246205,0.109139815,0.026940731,0.018006846,-0.0029406243,-0.026164878,0.08810284,-0.05634209,-0.09855291,-0.027423616,-0.054325853,0.057385016,-0.013816831,0.004280082,-0.022185177,-0.06750209,0.063628174,0.051255118,0.07390157,0.047030654,0.0406