441	4	136	The\nauthors of the method tracked the robot’s positions and the human collaborator’s hand\npositions during the demonstrations, with three different human motion velocities. The\nresults of a collaborative handover and transportation task showed that the duration of\nthe robot trajectory is strongly correlated with the human hand motion in the interac-\ntion part of the task. Proactive behavior was also observed, where the robot carried out\nthe task when the user was unsure of how to perform it, in order to show its intention\nand how to proceed.	3. Results	89	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.008950373,-0.03879566,0.010475705,-0.086221874,-0.01916594,-0.026949354,0.034547735,0.044361,-0.031968098,0.014821078,0.09973611,0.038722157,0.024126532,0.00058621366,0.031218657,-0.07806965,0.016952494,-0.016097946,-0.045522086,0.06548636,-0.009912781,-0.11649022,0.025639037,-0.03806233,-0.063932344,0.018635025,0.0260624,-0.07757964,0.051089726,0.020127602,-0.05133159,0.010871475,0.030490855,-0.0095361415,-0.11433754,0.06990135,-0.01720771,0.001308977,-0.014253431,-0.06536942,-0.060558654,-0.022106977,0.08051907,-0.03479015,0.055746973,0.13700296,0.06477495,-0.011722259,0.06278656,0.0489386,-0.028904282,-0.029632585,0.088451944,-0.07371722,0.014573263,0.0112916045,0.035140384,-0.044379454,0.032287315,0.0025910416,0.02694979,0.014393984,-0.036493342,0.0026646801,-0.03169879,-0.008385081,-0.032655407,-0.0388824,0.027655896,0.029535156,0.033729177,-0.041177686,0.011346182,-0.0052740234,-0.010951523,-0.0551142,0.021001665,-0.024382064,-0.04939451,-0.081467405,0.023209514,-0.06876168,-0.06346352,0.05775258,-0.057134267,0.05598159,-0.03073549,0.089969814,0.015560238,-0.010106103,-0.027035741,-0.034235127,-0.06452468,-0.12470978,-0.10230101,-0.036658265,-0.028310547,0.10484521,-0.012204588,0.026590766,0.0007693653,0.023142353,0.022272548,0.010859863,-0.051410496,0.046174977,0.03088362,-0.050225884,0.0621245,0.042075627,-0.039681368,-0.12167188,-0.061975602,0.020403093,0.0036976824,0.003169