451	4	146	LfD was integrated into the DDPG framework\nwith behavior cloning and a Q-filter. Demonstration of episodes by the controllers was\nadded to a demonstration replay buffer. An additional behavior cloning loss term was\nthen applied only to the samples of this buffer. The Q-filter ensured that the loss was not\napplied when the learned policy was significantly better than the demonstrated policy.	3. Results	62	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.040611472,-0.07756736,0.009917503,-0.0798141,0.072757214,0.055836067,0.030138824,-0.03944327,0.041081514,0.033860624,0.006070853,0.040230613,0.0074115004,-0.060528863,0.0036124424,0.01816694,0.08262402,0.07424852,-0.09043957,-0.05047636,0.044311047,-0.04589547,0.044020507,0.043012906,-0.06777168,-0.014622503,-0.039141364,-0.01320606,0.08363206,-0.07045009,0.037562285,0.07012251,-0.01772136,-0.07476861,-0.034862805,0.022272035,-0.03323607,-0.052612323,-0.057174813,-0.0543278,-0.022020694,-0.042275,-0.026440402,-0.0026629672,0.010555477,-0.0061679,-0.05299608,-0.02033073,-0.0022959765,-0.056443375,0.08055606,0.024095336,0.05550285,-0.039793793,0.03192089,0.06403843,0.06223005,0.055408116,0.006282217,0.10362986,-0.0372375,0.022049665,-0.005361999,0.055992775,0.0036409816,0.019133223,-0.01273713,-0.014907839,0.09299039,-0.03810054,-0.09329093,-0.027117958,-0.032750074,-0.054318637,0.05226162,0.0028214809,-0.031242209,-0.021161735,-0.034104172,-0.07822896,0.025801413,-0.05695316,0.00785191,0.029149393,-0.026734479,-0.060903568,-0.0028307652,0.005228778,0.04409027,0.00042090192,0.039420392,0.03582166,0.04294762,0.023215028,-0.06513194,-0.0125078205,0.007748719,-0.08028644,-0.0046563772,0.02087439,-0.00014472635,0.051019553,0.04555422,0.055590678,-0.0321485,-0.109254874,0.010921168,0.0061530834,-0.054397248,-0.03363914,0.022053676,0.090250984,0.0968201,0.07682292,0.040189855,-0.019398203,-0.03984206,-0.022819037,-0.077384226,-0.023223499,0.014740283,-0.09070116,0.013520123,0.0112129105,0.009771195,0.06771054,0.00044686376,7.702701e-34,0.0821097