461	4	156	In the work of [ 139], a different type of implicit assistance was given during the\ndeployment of a robotic agent for human–robot communication. The gaze of the human\nwas used to assist the robotic agent with visual grounding (locating the most relevant\nobject in an image based on a natural language query) in carrying out human instructions\nfor pick and place tasks. The approach used a Faster R-CNN model [ 141] for object\ndetection, a transformer-based text encoder model for text description embedding, and a\ntext classification model for scoring candidate locations in regard to the text descriptions.	3. Results	99	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.02794664,-0.058846675,0.027311185,-0.0074043395,0.043541446,0.029910613,0.051496297,0.034060054,-0.013662185,-0.07503019,0.06650589,0.05376747,0.021887297,0.08001787,0.07569638,-0.024210457,0.11166049,0.01579092,-0.05733195,0.011526453,0.03519429,0.033855967,0.06964327,0.0032908383,-0.0061972355,0.023394559,0.03886776,-0.05963152,-0.03969142,-0.030815873,0.0072202263,-0.025489947,0.039325826,0.10956889,-0.011987511,0.09887,-0.051269848,0.034540735,0.0010104759,-0.033448253,-0.038541548,-0.03409884,0.032617707,0.0039140317,0.10333796,0.050437056,-0.028154816,-0.05924423,0.057617944,-0.013668605,-0.032366704,0.02976967,0.005197332,0.025280919,-0.06056963,0.03421006,-0.024060998,-0.017349241,0.05908412,0.005953824,0.06684679,-0.048273407,0.071521066,0.006167579,-0.05990695,-0.03405987,0.02519134,-0.08340994,-0.007203677,-0.07154389,0.0035889305,0.07108914,0.050674267,-0.017195975,-0.019507144,-0.03796733,0.04712081,-0.037672557,0.053086963,-0.06321465,0.0062763034,-0.014587587,0.074680634,0.075823605,0.026626687,0.03251916,-0.012754779,0.055201855,0.0063774735,-0.021448435,0.00810641,-0.15891334,-0.00937759,-0.0705313,-0.05946542,0.012720742,-0.08299496,-0.013545247,-0.0899043,0.008388539,0.026077194,-0.042237673,0.01165766,-0.038407367,0.020673934,0.025816053,0.062695816,0.0035909668,0.04719087,-0.06913718,-0.03167996,-0.073949