480	4	175	We then identified and\ndiscussed the key takeaways of the analysis process. Lastly, we provided some recommendations for future research lines within the field\nof CI, with the aim of bridging the commonalities between the different topics that were\naddressed and achieving a more comprehensive and contextualized CI research landscape. Despite the advances in this field, it is still far from achieving true collaboration between\nhumans and AI-based systems that is proactive and involves purposeful interactions,\nadaptation to context, and an understanding of each other’s actions towards cooperative\nlearning and problem-solving [9].	5. Conclusions	92	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.0011862242,0.0492766,-0.07598808,0.003896936,0.027062949,-0.017392002,0.043313373,0.019230941,0.001949643,0.025531419,-0.046048913,-0.03138002,0.04137032,0.07533527,0.003335945,-0.020257922,-0.019380609,-0.046963118,-0.05288832,-0.027463648,-0.0627245,0.017932376,-0.02724826,-0.02278136,-0.041422155,0.056478996,0.037273612,-0.07243379,0.020791458,0.057630576,0.032703444,0.043823477,0.057009436,-0.004360932,-0.08305325,0.06864248,0.050030917,0.016939938,0.10269334,-0.04053996,-0.06263861,-0.0070238397,-0.00060926896,-0.007991194,0.01820837,0.0069470154,-0.11442409,-0.06416412,0.02069907,0.0012326476,-0.1831357,-0.019484457,0.02379485,-0.005285283,0.04003729,0.08951217,-0.0045683426,-0.01002387,0.015930379,-0.06080935,0.0079467315,-0.008649677,-0.012132027,0.06727146,0.02062857,0.046702504,-0.02511632,0.050494604,-0.00028917403,-0.09289536,-0.018894685,0.08837167,-0.042911764,-0.011461084,0.090964526,0.06432831,-0.058212407,-0.061732683,0.09472057,-0.10673164,0.057764,0.05634331,-0.001875128,0.038238727,0.030485658,-0.04713642,0.01871273,-0.0039665997,0.015645826,0.017220238,-0.023946049,-0.00523609,0.013325539,-0.04545044,0.042772256,0.0020432423,-0.04127603,0.0007334608,-0.03464414,0.06385018,-0.03332519,0.047207985,-0.044947963,-0.083639085,-0.07003462,0.0343956,0.049811903,-0.031116825,0.0927