491	5	8	Among these, cognitive forcing functions (CFFs) are\nstrategically designed interventions that can interrupt automatic, intuitive reasoning at the precise moment of decision\nmaking, causing individuals to shift toward a more deliberate, analytical thought process or System 2 thinking [43]. To encourage a shift from System 1 to System 2 thinking, with the goal to help overcome issues of over-trust or under-\ntrust by enhancing engaged task performance, we designed six decision-support mechanisms including a baseline text\nexplanation method.	AIAI	78	2	\N	\N	{}	[0.033421535,-0.04730532,0.040890332,-0.00016732332,0.09822834,-0.010106263,0.056180283,0.09350977,0.033794876,0.101221815,-0.01492379,-0.026436456,0.038752735,0.01254445,0.0827286,-0.022677483,0.031700637,-0.05330549,-0.046936043,0.025351727,0.027955206,-0.05655023,0.040276274,0.011903842,-0.058287147,0.022236543,-0.10577783,0.005695903,0.012012961,0.016563226,0.0037897816,0.005531821,0.008249968,-0.011733923,-0.09580432,-0.014099931,-0.042578463,0.092009775,-0.021488104,-0.035825845,-0.11847225,-0.042793434,0.022054892,0.02648608,0.005719713,0.017953357,0.021110188,0.009490225,0.012143134,-0.084887736,-0.14197417,0.005544282,-0.0128716715,-0.04710955,0.05776575,0.10207786,0.049562667,0.089999706,-0.04397834,-0.024819806,-0.05475901,-0.067280434,-0.09788148,0.021348348,-0.0013477027,0.14756736,-0.031022344,0.0045757606,-0.06853074,-2.0558002e-05,0.0101126125,0.041366637,0.032188896,-0.02869279,0.08747218,0.056811284,-0.09433872,-0.023025628,0.026155276,-0.024203235,0.033138074,0.06525425,0.0025217973,0.024660965,0.03683511,-0.0333346,0.019032922,-0.0015357904,0.081621885,0.0419757,0.032762207,-0.15827823,0.040668763,0.047141995,-0.07661691,0.023871148,-0.081662245,0.028033007,-0.097124904,0.014768547,-0.021526381,0.00065146567,-0.015919669,-0.0639244,-0.004615533,-0.10585614,0.05847836,0.010920558,0.06906413,-0.04614114,-0.02760085,-0.014989404,-0.027254585,-0.020987483,-0.016628077,0.05733004,0.10172