677	6	20	In industry, HAIC drives human–robot collaboration, optimizing production through\nthe synergy of AI’s computational capabilities and human creativity [ 44]. Collaborative\nrobots (cobots) assist in real-time decision making on factory floors, with humans guiding\nadaptability to unforeseen changes [ 45]. Decision patterns here blend AI’s rapid data\nprocessing with human oversight for safety and innovation. Challenges include ensuring\nsafe human–robot interactions, adapting to dynamic environments, and addressing ethical\nissues tied to workforce displacement and automation biases.	1. Introduction	76	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.047399525,-0.06464307,-0.038111985,-0.040315483,0.07604262,-0.00955784,-0.023093557,-0.0657377,-0.05933873,0.041538328,-0.010193552,-0.0014708497,0.014065157,-0.009539886,0.01725616,0.0032857328,0.025443962,-0.099809185,-0.056854863,-0.042572945,-0.00092378666,0.016759194,0.0061599785,-0.033447225,-0.03696499,0.06804689,0.06871346,-0.046720356,0.0049266187,-0.030947333,0.0015960895,0.008659447,0.08629229,-0.021496514,0.032707818,0.076412536,0.0040369397,-0.0018156061,0.08342621,-0.039287575,-0.026571685,-0.0611516,-0.064124554,-0.019592749,0.0065226406,0.07798056,-0.032893583,-0.10890673,0.043767605,0.026745515,-0.0911306,0.0090060495,0.06642565,-0.00791896,-0.02322084,0.047137544,0.06409223,-0.022599814,0.055105876,-0.033127688,0.015258541,-0.037485056,0.06854288,0.011716135,0.055726912,-0.01645091,-0.10845869,-0.012574652,0.00023846855,-0.01347718,0.03797298,0.057016548,-0.01988071,-0.01753083,0.01193545,-0.002021574,-0.027661856,-0.098877236,0.06905655,-0.059696782,-0.049104895,-0.024510825,-0.022277128,0.09587637,-0.005235465,0.0295706,0.020411057,0.029281551,0.10600073,-0.015648836,-0.035306364,-0.07802423,0.02631413,-0.043084424,-0.046891663,0.013812707,-0.013528692,0.02218916,-0.0562805,-0.036910806,-0.072877094,-9.210403e-05,-0.07145767,-0.015629716,0.013201326,-0.031348985,0.053927433,0.017475825,0.0938029,0.010515747,-0.06308562,-0.01