639	5	156	Open text entry\n[General Post-Study Questions for All Conditions]\nWe designed the following questions to assess participant experience with the explanation mechanisms across all\nconditions, including for confidence and clarity, consistency and cognitive load, ease and usefulness, trust and\ncomfort, and trust dynamics. Confidence and Understanding:\n•Confidence in AI’s Decision:\nHow confident did you feel in the AI’s meal choice? Scale: 1 (Not confident at all) to 7 (Extremely confident)\n•Understanding of AI Output:\nHow well did you understand the [condition-specific content] for picking a meal? Scale: 1 (Not at all) to 7 (Extremely well)\nConsistency and Cognitive Load:\n•AI Decision Consistency:\nHow consistent did you feel the AI’s meal choices were across different image pairs? Scale: 1 (Not consistent at all) to 7 (Extremely consistent)\n•Mental Demand of Task:\nI thought the task of picking the right meal was mentally demanding. Scale: 1 (Not at all) to 7 (Extremely demanding)\nEase and Usefulness:\n•AI’s Helpfulness in Decision-Making:\nDid the AI make the task of picking the right meal easier? Scale: 1 (Not at all) to 7 (Very much so)\n•Willingness to Use AI System:\nI would like to use this system frequently. Scale: 1 (Strongly disagree) to 7 (Strongly agree)\n•Future Use of AI System:\nI would like to use this system in future decision-making tasks. Scale: 1 (Not at all) to 7 (Very much so)\nTrust and Comfort:\n•Trust in AI vs. Own Judgment:\nHow much did you trust the AI’s judgment compared to your own? Scale: 1 (Not at all) to 7 (A lot)\n•Trust Increase Through AI Assistance:\nDid the AI’s assistance increase your trust in its recommendations? Scale: 1 (Not at all) to 7 (Very much so)\n•Comfort in Relying on AI:\nHow comfortable would you be relying on this AI to help make meal-related decisions for Type 2 diabetics? Scale: 1 (Not at all) to 7 (Extremely comfortable)\nTrust Dynamics:\n•Trust Change Over Time:\nHow did your trust in the AI change from the beginning to the end of the task? Scale: 1 (No change) to 7 (Changed completely)\nEngaging with AI	6.7.4 Questionnaire Content	348	13	\N	\N	{}	[0.011449471,0.020216867,0.023505729,0.10266639,0.003933381,-0.02199017,0.07244585,0.11346542,0.022801386,0.03462078,-0.03443426,-0.06716701,0.00040528626,0.0096346075,0.021006327,-0.030741373,0.11271858,-0.043744806,-0.15688322,0.045822307,0.024975926,-0.054821916,0.058095917,-0.01099614,-0.023668451,-0.01207841,-0.03566619,0.0010272714,-0.08409306,-0.054106683,-0.046680603,0.035516102,0.07680285,-0.018771749,-0.07255675,-0.0028189754,-0.0062616784,-0.015856879,-0.03701248,-0.08227156,-0.028538099,-0.018997211,0.05728743,-0.04593894,0.045649927,-0.05915222,-0.06942943,-0.05039482,-0.010496489,0.033413254,-0.12544431,-0.03054451,-0.029666599,-0.01393017,0.02117733,0.07443814,0.022025255,-0.023086319,-0.08699337,-0.041117467,-0.023833089,-0.03040802,-0.020254903,0.006729036,0.03829905,0.05348208,-0.0721757,-0.07845242,-0.030459743,-0.015576059,-0.015567694,0.011732959,0.028299697,-0.01633914,0.03068673,-0.032818936,-0.014798958,-0.07474884,0.0122087635,-0.010625,-0.054529104,0.13259175,0.04539399,0.046170045,-0.021345085,-0.07698536,0.04752716,0.012391567,0.032656293,0.03287168,0.08261337,0.021402722,-0.009324437,0.021978088,0.15092967,0.0551768,-0.08563209,-0.06957838,-0.048258804,0.029237192,0.050117012,0.07864047,-0.0024566592,0.009247121,-0.0381852,0.02183864,0.026185073,-0.03676334,0.011721719,-0.043525267,-0.07713355,-0.03306609,0.027373036,0.0017201655,0.017384375,-0.02031494,0.023069827,0.043834094,0.112142965,0.05259608,0.016056878,0.0069161844,0.08425485,0.005688009,0.014697242,-0.020782499,0.03848122,5.1725704e-33,-0.05189108,-0.008136943,0.058036808,0.018737832,0.012780458,-0.058919743,-0.012852874,0.08240819,-0.022790346,-0.026373979,0.009956819,0.08787666,-0.025571078,0.055444937,0.06015825,-0.0009737261,-0.039567064,0.052961115,-0.006391142,0.06211982,0.039393853,-0.043858733,0.0309787,0.0132621