655	5	172	Prediction: The AI model processes the historical decision data and the nutritional profiles of the new meals. By identifying patterns in how the participant has historically selected meals based on their nutritional con-\ntent, the model calculates the probability that the participant will make the correct choice in the new task. Engaging with AI\nAlgorithm 1: Human Confidence Level Prediction for Meal Selection\nInput: Historical decision data D={D1, D2, . . . , D n}, where each Dicontains:\n• Nutritional profiles of two meals: M1i(Meal 1), M2i(Meal 2)\n• Ground truth for correct meal GTi\n• User’s choice Ui\nNutritional profiles for current query meals M1,M2, ground truth GT new\nOutput: Predicted confidence level (CL) of the user selecting the correct meal as a percentage (0-100%)\nInitialize\nInitialize system prompt Psys:\n"Return the predicted likelihood as a percentage (0-100%) of the user choosing the correct meal based\non their past behavior and the nutritional profile required for controlling blood sugar in diabetes patients."\nInitialize empty user data prompt Pdata\nProcess Historical Data\nforeach Di∈ D do\nExtract nutritional profiles M1iandM2ifrom Di:\nM1i← {calories, fat, carbohydrates, protein }\nM2i← {calories, fat, carbohydrates, protein }\nDetermine ground truth GTiforDi;\nRecord the user’s decision UiforDi;\nAppend to data prompt Pdata:\n"Record i:M1i,M2i, Ground Truth = GTi, User’s Choice = Ui."\nProcess New Query\nExtract nutritional profiles for current query:\nM1← {calories, fat, carbohydrates, protein }\nM2← {calories, fat, carbohydrates, protein }\nDetermine ground truth GT newfor current query;\nAppend current query information to Pdata:\n"New Query: M1,M2, Ground Truth = GT new."\nGenerate Prediction\nSend system prompt Psysand data prompt Pdata to a LLM L;\nLprocesses historical decisions Dand the nutritional profiles of both current query meals to predict the user’s\nlikelihood of selecting the correct meal;\nReturn predicted CL as a percentage (0-100%).	6.9.1 Human CL Prediction for Meal Selection	301	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.042643867,0.0046740132,-0.049644772,0.06840439,-0.022670627,-0.022528235,0.06091849,0.098925054,-0.06836473,-0.017565863,-0.030625246,-0.11277299,0.03680832,-0.06324792,0.04346414,-0.03296828,0.11341582,-0.06636117,-0.067762785,-0.03022707,0.07122687,-0.0094928015,0.009776778,-0.027416475,0.018439483,-0.02329097,0.042359624,-0.032609534,-0.09316658,0.041617807,-0.016510487,0.014923611,0.08538855,-0.005281279,-0.08275235,-0.05244564,-0.03328789,-0.013396462,-0.06529943,-0.049097233,-0.022340577,0.013969378,-0.021163253,0.013941898,0.05783422,-0.046887472,-0.10796662,0.008850954,0.019743603,0.05260138,-0.119751975,0.0017683408,0.010198885,0.017462565,0.0550371,0.003189842,0.00086713413,-0.0063536675,-0.06753047,-0.07821715,-0.05614455,-0.025829552,-0.07771544,-0.020642651,0.08293666,0.0070720585,-0.042004745,-0.028393118,0.033269078,-0.032532662,-0.079034165,0.03447133,-0.058739603,-0.013025436,0.0048153773,0.051234256,-0.0062388475,0.0047601196,-0.020824984,-0.049600113,-0.031055905,0.08082391,-0.0016885642,0.031784583,0.048715293,-0.033584226,0.006236864,0.009693647,0.04422255,-0.0032852816,0.028512934,0.017671188,-0.03185045,0.041978028,0.03795016,0.038464833,-0.04903538,-0.14260805,0.05503946,0.021126112,-0.06207637,0.061625764,-0.0014324981,0.036167085,-0.04755298,-0.045436103,0.023433398,0.04532476,0.018578375,0.03100152,0.008399103,0.028525867,0.037953086,0.0007918315,-0.0026836281,0.025070364,0.027199334,-0.023379387,-0.008153133,0.061638705,-0.03854665,0.068246305,0.055511523,0.05069969,0.07417536,-0.032906104,-0.0018727647,7.7468075e-33,-0.05272768,-0.11580478,0.049202647,-0.021611996,0.010787117,0.022476375,-0.045812342,0.04529325,0.09146934,0.0001949505,-0.055889446,-0.023706602,-0.035959207,0.017226335,0.012586199,0.009265268,0.0025240816,0.032401286,-0.004959322,0.06809134,0.021112852,0.023177253,0.08126088,-0.011923572,0.030776389,0.11170137,0.0066719465,0.06