672	6	15	This framework provides a theoretical foundation for designing\nAI systems that promote appropriate reliance through accurate capability communication\nand uncertainty expression [33].\n1.1.2. Applications of HAIC\nAI has evolved into an integral collaborative partner in complex decision-making\nprocesses. This evolution has enabled HAIC to deeply penetrate various vertical domains,\nrevealing distinct collaborative patterns and challenges, particularly in high-risk decision\nenvironments where human intuition intersects with AI-driven insights.	1. Introduction	67	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.011627525,-0.02982909,-0.00025531827,-0.026410418,0.03698401,-0.039196964,0.0500792,0.031140564,0.034929045,0.027031528,-0.09134378,-0.031036394,0.07073254,0.040456478,-0.016853366,0.05662,0.04182072,-0.080601685,-0.07752817,-0.011979571,-0.017741991,0.021174945,-0.011198588,-0.043447774,-0.00823547,0.02696882,-0.027184445,0.03622396,0.012946748,-0.0032928905,0.0738497,0.048237007,0.052559875,-0.05128464,-0.03792558,0.06727387,-0.043055598,0.024601419,0.078329705,-0.054602955,-0.004476219,-0.02411669,-0.0154922735,-0.03519013,0.012582891,0.024748225,-0.011039321,-0.03796035,0.008723477,0.0019109128,-0.14120337,-0.024868267,0.013398432,-0.0757148,0.062586874,0.12376234,-0.034203824,-0.014474371,-0.06066115,-0.059181437,-0.012872441,-0.05720227,0.0059260656,-0.01976495,0.046793316,0.041293908,-0.054000083,0.07766254,-0.009914276,-0.0049890927,0.06505843,0.06794737,-0.0592434,-0.025275182,-0.002998216,0.02066924,0.014903664,-0.052348856,0.027528957,-0.07442041,-0.06079907,0.073101275,0.006438664,0.10423684,0.047923356,0.0047505046,0.06692805,-0.058795314,0.1044613,0.0038097277,0.0048641455,-0.12709276,0.059937917,0.010410391,0.035061788,0.048814226,-0.03688371,-0.01471875,-0.10377303,0.036615383,-0.008513339,0.03823935,-0.0756487,-0.08187861,-0.0065355543,-0.060845643,0.058851466,-0.009499324,0.06725431,-0.011486865,-0.03886122,-0.03843164,0.05396364,-0.011170459,-0.015973967,-0.026841