682	6	25	Privacy and data usage also pose dilemmas that intersect with collaboration dynamics. AI systems often rely on vast personal datasets, raising concerns about consent and secu-\nrity, particularly in sensitive areas like medical diagnostics and intelligence analysis [ 49]. As humans and AI iterate in a bidirectional learning process, the risks of data misuse\nor breaches grow, potentially compromising both user trust and system integrity.	1. Introduction	65	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.027067421,-0.0077895494,-0.03808047,0.015842382,0.008059627,-0.00063089275,0.018574046,0.008679456,0.073717244,0.0019893902,0.010633444,0.056504462,0.047145057,-0.007923652,-0.008641045,-0.014842342,-0.013998497,-0.054964572,-0.100601695,0.006693457,-0.04918575,-0.0064043803,-0.04458398,0.021273524,-0.014723487,0.016964791,0.082342334,-0.11019169,-0.035742316,-0.035347495,0.07650668,0.0053569386,0.021166956,0.028402414,-0.053605564,-0.044306014,0.017484946,0.0067800186,0.023540413,-0.032134216,-0.03518678,-0.07209696,-0.024912644,0.061928958,0.009059421,0.06741371,-0.021890154,-0.06002147,0.029272666,0.013706549,-0.13664025,-0.020321535,0.05235989,0.04798956,-0.069911525,-0.021007823,-0.031962577,0.01818975,-0.079052575,0.048768982,-0.035217013,-0.044477317,0.025610173,0.025354922,0.07971732,0.04223474,-0.013630166,0.0338265,0.02094538,-0.026561629,0.040751755,0.06374511,-0.03732352,0.03197651,0.024543416,0.016018158,-0.06743807,-0.030075684,0.06684303,-0.11858825,-0.000540791,0.033124965,0.041320316,0.05297244,0.020481635,-0.04791558,0.017095972,-0.06160747,0.036909718,-0.033084802,0.013181023,-0.05307196,0.096002504,0.014582129,0.07924081,0.062357478,-0.03528439,-0.025530208,-0.0015342903,0.009441412,-0.093575865,0.0636903,-0.05335061,0.031725097,0.033465896,0.0635167,0.021997705,-0.06927984,0.06962745,0.018712845,-0.00577871,0.010399157,-0.019994225,-0.03991917,0.11863448,-0.040847566,-0.09218134,0.045721825,-0.00992254,0.045482267,-0.04604684,-0.04695649,0.012108171,0.07367673,-0.005033