724	6	67	What remains absent from the literature is the systematic investigation of\nwhether metacognitive training or interface scaffolding can close the gap between theoreti-\ncal complementarity and observed performance, and whether the task-type moderation\nidentified by Vaccaro et al. [ 18] reflects fundamental cognitive constraints or merely current\ndesign limitations.\n3.2.2. Strategy 2: Adaptive User-Centered Design\nResearch on adaptive design divides between computational adaptation and interac-\ntive co-creation approaches. Computational adaptation aims to automatically adjust AI\nsupport based on inferred user states.	3. Results	81	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.040041428,-0.07134428,-0.029852636,-0.004537458,0.03560881,0.012605085,0.04099108,0.049909092,-0.08400399,0.018143052,-0.12357988,-0.030129228,0.025213659,-0.0061720223,0.01257909,-0.074929796,0.058526844,-0.061795287,0.021986322,0.013576771,0.07962122,-0.0069542485,0.068731084,0.00023330258,-0.0017122837,0.038296834,-0.07986145,-0.03325517,0.05358054,-0.0058649583,0.020832524,0.055637848,-0.016218046,-0.010671945,-0.060515936,0.015365766,-0.0027675678,0.115641795,0.051378958,-0.058601383,-0.15336274,-0.02337003,-0.048120935,-0.025844505,0.042434994,0.024094641,-0.06651501,-0.07982683,-0.048141506,0.012915905,-0.08616568,-0.008985296,0.0028362207,-0.020605452,-0.022013733,0.09092986,0.05303396,0.0548862,-0.0049785865,-0.026626036,-0.021528285,-0.07613428,0.01293671,0.010783639,0.08612675,0.023440307,-0.033343334,-0.0048288074,0.0077863047,-0.039804082,-0.010749539,0.09814512,0.008989782,0.027132064,0.09191419,0.034214165,-0.04580859,-0.018643739,0.11569095,-0.059916537,0.032918945,0.107020125,-0.055513013,0.037543938,0.039439015,-0.039092805,0.010764793,0.0039073005,0.039324205,-0.049089044,0.06844939,0.020680783,-0.000637143,-0.031810604,-0.051513962,-0.019510962,0.019415248,0.002382192,-0.038583573,0.058654156,0.0001891693,0.05631967,-0.0011592755,-0.030575985,-0.00055637973,0.036147796,0.020400345,0.06573709,