733	6	76	Strategy 3: Context-Aware Task Allocation\nContext-aware allocation addresses how decision-making responsibilities should be\ndistributed based on task characteristics and situational factors. Research divides between\ntaxonomic approaches specifying predetermined allocations and dynamic approaches\nadjusting in real-time. Taxonomic approaches aim to classify tasks by optimal human–AI division. Korent-\nsides et al. adapted the HABA-MABA framework for aviation, allocating skill-based\nand rule-based tasks to AI while preserving human authority over knowledge-based and\nexpertise-based decisions [ 77].	3. Results	73	4	\N	\N	{}	[0.05304711,-0.029261064,-0.10194064,-0.027209261,0.01793081,-0.01676898,0.09820362,0.005485522,-0.038639188,0.11898717,-0.061158374,-0.011275687,-0.03889584,0.09929711,0.012951518,-0.013767426,0.03881028,-0.02126117,-0.07489026,-0.010851511,0.09407016,0.04956235,0.05505572,0.01555798,-0.06480093,-0.011076222,0.01486398,-0.07792587,0.03210437,-0.034845617,0.07734241,0.030001579,0.14571926,0.008327605,-0.05692063,0.05040188,-0.09910936,-0.02012981,0.033736065,0.028344722,-0.04753328,-0.015380872,-0.06710752,0.024992667,-0.016553286,0.05101369,-0.026171511,0.0527514,0.027174383,0.028470648,-0.09645264,-0.036573466,-0.014468335,-0.03967088,-0.0051683476,0.08312321,-0.018551093,0.0050146473,0.04346115,-0.027736876,-0.04492988,-0.050682586,0.024426643,0.009565914,0.014337318,0.023378048,-0.043523837,-0.034068637,0.007504088,-0.02558926,0.005038732,0.10026717,-0.002191562,0.0060169995,0.025924826,0.003555071,0.052976973,-0.011935828,0.010151728,-0.0460144,0.015969032,0.028427694,-0.04644664,0.043026928,0.04978926,-0.02214351,-0.05065856,0.008262466,0.089177065,-0.008627888,-0.015623424,-0.13788025,0.13225013,-0.062148713,-0.027293587,0.022030141,-0.043244377,0.0282391,-0.048139613,-0.024297161,0.0026104182,-0.061865646,-0.05168947,-0.00093728234,-0.00902141,0.039083477,0.028593613,-0.042560823,0.059705563,-0.04417056,-0.08985136,0.08166181,-