753	6	96	The performance paradox documented by Vaccaro\net al. [ 18] indicates that human–AI combinations frequently fail to achieve complemen-\ntarity’s theoretical benefits, underperforming the best individual agent in decision tasks. The adaptive design literature is fragmented between computational and co-creation ap-\nproaches, neither of which has been validated with diverse, technology-naive populations\nfacing realistic tasks.	3. Results	55	2	\N	\N	{}	[-0.011329947,-0.027270831,-0.03211901,-0.041208517,-0.044619575,-0.0662491,0.027032398,0.006459651,0.034889873,0.062451806,-0.090396106,0.0020069524,0.022739712,-0.031493653,0.020109296,-0.021841113,0.075032495,-0.029694274,0.022701344,-0.04692937,-0.0024067021,-0.005760325,0.065984726,-0.0526945,-0.025136288,0.006390765,-0.07588421,-0.039049998,0.076023676,-0.045528866,0.0402032,-0.028881744,0.056149673,-0.01642615,-0.08004536,0.044908125,-0.04439419,0.055342104,0.084608726,0.023587266,-0.030713407,-0.0029056857,-0.0535838,-0.018270846,0.018203394,0.011460611,-0.05717679,-0.04455761,-0.012426521,0.0057147904,-0.09157126,-0.005250781,0.010270008,-0.020087581,-0.03893488,0.05309402,-0.023358705,0.08586959,-0.016378365,-0.09117659,-0.023872329,-0.08037484,0.039384905,0.026357112,0.08724863,0.05009542,0.022074925,-0.032903988,-0.021597985,-0.0023512465,0.020910904,0.06725127,-0.021742713,0.010496809,0.061072364,0.027857129,-0.00056763575,0.030682936,0.06536897,-0.0058388123,0.012121363,-0.010540627,-0.07357151,0.049770493,0.056375977,-0.0061437883,-0.0065666027,-0.012111639,0.058885872,-0.054067284,0.0036861936,-0.06186069,0.05735748,-0.010699811,0.013449084,0.079356246,0.016840162,-0.004844177,-0.087817185,0.013702637,-0.056242585,0.011378693,-0.029143017,0.0197931,0.051150363,-0.0036343278,0.07990043,-0.04813204,0.06549485,-0.0016211515,0.0074636317,0.023720713,0.036717586,-0.01921581,0.009525974,0.0025235566,-0.086279415,0.052645672,0.07857359,0.03644622,0.046808273,-0.039162423,0.037531096,0.043536536,0.04381