764	6	107	Explanatory dialogs and justifications improved collaboration effectiveness and in-\nfluenced reliance behaviors. AI systems providing justifications and AR-based visual\nguidance demonstrated improved task performance, shared awareness, and reduced er-\nrors compared to systems without these explanatory elements [ 107]. These approaches\nwere particularly effective when combined with prescriptive and descriptive guidance that\ncontextualized AI recommendations within the user’s task environment.\n3.3.3.	3. Results	61	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.026737625,-0.06840418,-0.06527649,0.018342575,0.0735003,-0.0026988976,0.06876164,0.039253652,-0.01017828,-0.04063291,-0.065103956,-0.0060217357,-0.004998713,0.059987828,0.05677542,0.004429779,0.13203931,-0.09571647,-0.06942411,-0.047819547,0.022336824,0.030681567,0.0061494987,-0.012963671,-0.03568311,0.041173168,-0.027149748,-0.06624502,0.026572756,0.0085516395,0.0010321786,-0.012572643,0.066659324,-0.041928776,-0.1474587,0.06975491,0.002252014,0.08678143,0.033473194,-0.050801393,-0.0887952,0.076632544,-3.0895928e-05,-0.038223572,0.056825254,0.019837363,-0.09141328,-0.071914755,0.02329838,0.016425468,-0.1475418,-0.041268494,0.05041681,-0.047676664,0.025271077,0.099658616,0.0144389225,0.07549973,0.0061749965,-0.07348411,0.005590268,-0.083775274,-0.014622831,0.010547206,0.0058457213,0.07359815,0.044577077,-0.030481184,-0.044184946,-0.0065413723,-0.055067398,0.108423755,0.009973007,-0.035172608,-0.034105577,0.073646545,-0.04788295,-0.07047909,0.009822429,-0.06602392,-0.0005382644,0.024838405,0.00025752094,0.06415545,0.006147433,-0.005609733,0.0021461963,-0.024947083,0.06804374,0.028829522,0.059045263,-0.064365834,-0.008550545,0.018435448,0.021428138,0.05573571,-0.08085348,-0.110487945,-0.12393385,0.043059345,0.055252872,0.018414216,0.011904844,-0.10723071,0.009197172,-0.049880117,0.051587317,0.0027104684,0.019001832,0.022689357,-0.03577118,-0.051540226,-0.01935407,-0.06224654,0.02219413,-0.05839697,0.015477909,-0.019301273,0.066784