771	6	114	Error types significantly influenced reliance patterns, with research showing that\nhumans were less likely to delegate complex predictions to AI when it made rare but large\nerrors, driven by higher self-confidence rather than lower confidence in the model [ 111]. Additionally, humans violated choice independence in HAIC, with errors in one domain\naffecting delegation decisions in others.	3. Results	57	2	\N	\N	{}	[-0.013179476,-0.050232697,0.05356512,0.08200474,0.03477487,-0.0065554194,0.033164732,0.05019304,0.040033232,0.037778504,-0.013834095,-0.004519417,0.047535215,-0.031221671,0.023894837,-0.019941786,0.0078437105,-0.063241914,-0.07852932,0.020930357,-0.02300401,0.01936819,-0.04534555,-0.0022269497,-0.013455504,-0.01610063,-0.060949553,-0.025086636,0.02251112,-0.061356433,0.005254248,0.03491362,0.015600243,-0.05049914,-0.064475276,-0.0028117474,-0.033017766,-0.008552807,0.054972135,-0.042516597,0.042006996,0.015443999,0.053988244,-0.028872108,-0.033028573,-0.0027668201,-0.00397085,-0.031497613,-0.040607788,-0.013614182,-0.059494916,0.061369322,0.07460409,-0.062388103,0.021577803,0.008530611,0.024956616,0.09295531,0.026382241,-0.0011485299,-0.016489169,-0.018085582,-0.027324198,-0.03180628,0.08756421,0.05751593,-0.017508956,-0.021311253,-0.025290478,-0.019934637,0.08881197,-0.013115384,-0.072810404,0.0149564445,0.08973252,-0.03820203,0.0004993307,-0.034040228,0.04036711,-0.0643591,-0.081072964,-0.004754489,0.041395176,0.0696275,0.08307853,-0.044881217,0.01792793,-0.016956521,0.06249243,-0.0026308934,0.0531029,-0.09921084,0.060631316,0.039076272,0.05518875,0.07097298,0.008095755,-0.014771165,-0.03816053,0.020910088,0.050489005,0.064164795,-0.11536896,-0.011924966,0.01225857,-0.056811158,0.06456644,-0.06101899,0.03733793,0.001948396,-0.09560957,0.016173288,-0.019822437,0.007898005,-0.017679017,-0.10085044,-0.078266196,0.04046286,-0.042792704,0.0034675533,-0.026865711,-0.06642327,0.09038843,0.0146320965,0.021938896,-0.020634301,-0.08548024,5.8733355e-34