772	6	115	In clinical settings, a more nuanced picture of reliance behaviors emerged beyond\nsimple acceptance or rejection patterns. Clinicians demonstrated four distinct behavior\npatterns when engaging with AI treatment recommendations: ignore, negotiate, consider,\nand rely [ 109]. This “negotiation” process highlighted that reliance behaviors represent\ncomplex, multi-faceted responses that extend beyond binary measures and are significantly\ninfluenced by how AI systems present information and enable interaction. In summary, the research on presentation and interaction approaches reveals a field\nthat has generated numerous interventions without establishing the fundamental condi-\ntions under which they succeed or fail.	3. Results	94	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.022056658,-0.026500732,-0.000311183,0.050789326,-0.020788185,0.005367159,0.026594572,0.09621933,0.067823514,-0.08659808,-0.079751424,-0.028683335,0.010380042,0.034781147,0.027872968,0.07952729,0.120447606,-0.051562946,-0.0045017395,0.027133517,-0.006912153,0.043635543,0.010492621,0.005676389,-0.09555968,0.014096743,-0.10589918,-0.07934041,0.084509805,0.013622604,0.03024689,0.017903712,-0.02475725,0.029165823,-0.13383354,0.02242643,-0.059159778,0.06471675,-0.01068728,-0.041940477,-0.012228725,0.026178377,0.07519815,-0.07153577,0.064283654,-0.046580218,-0.041118603,0.042302985,7.2167563e-06,-0.028596126,-0.15178107,-0.00043473896,0.085293055,-0.005263481,0.020906761,0.040770944,0.037632395,0.08613768,0.026089324,-0.008607973,0.024496425,-0.050635125,0.0092218425,0.049563807,-0.005072813,0.12004851,-0.04591498,-0.015886685,-0.054358784,-0.008535064,0.00430888,0.0049456274,0.012093506,0.010483634,0.07443067,-0.019554995,-0.029795991,-0.06002103,0.08568994,-0.031851158,-0.031910993,0.022975577,0.022938207,0.08227005,-0.04131623,-0.05857871,-0.001982008,-0.019867482,0.06792951,0.008114614,0.022684366,0.009202512,-0.07092109,-0.00241663,-0.01752519,-0.017878747,-0.023803005,-0.060707998,-0.08622443,0.03712027,0.058579918,