808	6	151	Future\nimplementation efforts must focus on holistic approaches that address trust calibration,\nskill preservation, and accountability challenges simultaneously rather than pursuing these\ndimensions in isolation. In summary, the ethical and practical implications of AI integration in high-risk con-\ntexts reveal a troubling disjunction between the urgency of deployment and the maturity\nof understanding. Trust calibration in these contexts faces unique challenges—the gen-\neralization phenomenon documented by Duan et al. [ 114] and the capability–morality\ntension identified by Tolmeijer et al. [ 117]—that general HAIC research does not address\nand that existing interventions may be inadequate to resolve.	3. Results	97	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.023560598,-0.02415518,-0.03644495,-0.033820275,0.013385865,0.030257536,-0.0023951305,-0.044241004,0.013688646,0.025984533,0.030515388,0.013602542,0.07357088,0.0062309885,-0.013924759,0.04039997,-0.038840607,-0.025641197,-0.09152602,-0.018933957,-0.01065658,0.020648936,0.021749474,0.009768188,0.0038796829,-0.014507954,-0.029032344,-0.055552505,-0.036949832,0.03680424,0.024041776,0.04813821,0.03496601,0.023355471,-0.019526687,0.04234339,0.00020465744,0.0077534043,0.06497795,-0.09456221,-0.006076856,-0.05836998,0.023594523,0.0040378035,0.061601013,0.02119639,0.0129773,-0.001516187,-0.083106555,-0.04047129,-0.12987806,-0.06296966,0.055716887,0.006626612,-0.053928234,0.06981207,0.05238424,0.033442527,0.014940283,-0.01172405,-0.016464442,0.0066890004,-0.042832457,-0.003491262,0.051766377,0.091837555,0.008987678,-0.015306959,-0.046592414,-0.015512229,0.00020218929,0.052822527,0.04584478,0.010195002,-0.0435745,0.04707453,-0.019908706,0.025230747,0.118611485,-0.12784171,0.016220449,0.051216293,0.07839206,0.098970674,-0.059988618,-0.008316316,0.09255501,-0.05599207,0.13404888,0.05941919,0.057466693,-0.11327014,0.053614937,0.0458398,0.010867956,0.006584339,-0.033166345,-0.040793464,-0.08642466,-0.002738071,0.009472307,-0.035965,-0.03