815	6	158	Conflicting Findings and Resolution Needs\nOur synthesis reveals several substantive conflicts requiring a comprehensive investi-\ngation. The performance paradox presents contradictory evidence: while some research\nInformatics 2025 ,12, 135 29 of 36\nfound human–AI combinations often underperformed individual agents, numerous studies\nreport significant performance gains [ 18]. Task-type moderation appears critical, with deci-\nsion tasks showing performance losses and creative tasks demonstrating gains, suggesting\ndomain-specific optimization requirements.	3. Results	67	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.017348632,-0.014308085,-0.026877299,-0.035420965,0.037376914,-0.04970713,0.057247207,-0.0063019996,0.006525319,0.029655147,-0.08287874,-0.0262887,0.01430131,-0.005475376,0.034916025,-0.005938201,0.039751664,-0.02759197,-0.034261107,-0.03666477,0.02611349,0.010577559,0.054948952,-0.043403175,-0.03984854,-0.016935667,-0.017458828,-0.09158884,0.052252147,-0.025594417,0.0530211,0.042366076,0.076074265,-0.01722909,-0.048423715,0.08455618,-0.0019601232,0.0067642173,0.08918251,-0.04432906,-0.0009246391,-0.036983367,-4.0068615e-05,-0.041133553,0.076130345,-0.0152463,-0.070160545,-0.06274666,-0.041390058,0.015373143,-0.13032077,-0.00355374,0.048340246,-0.04554137,-0.043440033,-0.011238105,0.009754193,0.09943438,-0.011868848,-0.04376933,0.039070893,-0.075054005,0.009416395,-0.02994656,0.09907139,0.045876626,0.02792874,-0.05223264,0.00277902,-0.013381718,0.061212555,0.005451145,-0.03566472,0.022366112,0.050923787,0.019788664,0.004749212,0.00062412757,0.079675995,-0.06995845,0.0341289,0.0030388813,0.0023290042,0.0516879,-0.012530408,-0.027455779,-0.0034407352,0.0025115397,0.055969372,0.014718087,0.023898795,-0.07748435,0.08372566,-0.045509618,0.029333148,0.03955291,-0.032396067,-0.06070765,-0.04206748,0.044117227,0.0046408684,0.074412264,-0.037243955,-0.033827443,0.0011675769,-0.034350753,0.1006904,-0.00089897425,0.01727036,-0.018406903,-0.04385134,0.016854864,0.05445221,-0.0018969207