832	7	3	Automation technology is implemented in companies of high-risk industries (e.g.,\nenergy supply, aviation, and maritime industries) for reasons such as ensuring safety\nand increasing economic beneﬁts [ 1–4]. The implementation of automation technology in\nmany organizational processes in high-risk industries has led to a change in the nature\nof work [ 5,6]. Due to highly automated environments, operators in high-risk industries\nare required to handle tasks that are increasingly complex and demand predominately\ncognitive skills [ 6].	1. Introduction	77	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.021619692,-0.026891958,0.00104768,-0.045664296,-0.018918613,-0.0015193676,0.096252486,0.06917302,-0.060169227,0.05460973,0.0050067864,0.041233655,0.02395429,0.046566278,0.03460058,-0.04684741,0.0141299665,-0.0918713,-0.08152651,-0.0797982,0.044194646,-0.012124491,-0.01766128,0.020370407,-0.055740006,-0.0056851753,0.007466246,-0.0070593464,-0.017682903,0.01354156,-0.069393456,-0.04333489,0.10777204,0.023884872,-0.025991583,-0.029741181,-0.026067313,0.051674433,0.054389164,-0.12971471,-0.045929305,-0.112645,-0.04998928,-0.006615301,-0.010582324,0.019369,-0.029215673,-0.12733117,0.0042831274,-0.04174278,-0.13214037,0.021694701,0.072878644,-0.086517796,-0.01882161,0.017341085,0.07266926,-0.022579039,-0.0030257783,-0.04353452,-0.006011048,-0.038926654,0.008872647,0.015617214,0.015043517,0.04728074,-0.05436585,-0.039749786,-0.0638371,-0.027970206,-0.032798044,-0.07396778,-0.031851344,0.037591208,0.05374647,-0.035066392,-0.082609944,-0.0673903,0.025206888,-0.0055337125,0.022787297,-0.03153232,-0.01773414,0.06999955,-0.045395084,0.034082677,-0.052454032,0.029668342,0.066604756,0.015477521,-0.0015434353,-0.16044357,0.008786474,0.0054450002,0.060057692,0.019727323,0.011479758,-0.03675686,-0.0072018057,-0.080027685,0.05633179,-0.029296573,-0.028703367,-0.010421901,-0.05044235,-0.012101493,0.03784872,-0.028558249,0.073921815,-0.061705317,-0.049777206,0.039054684,-0.039315242,-0.049744792,-0.09864058,0.031