954	8	35	Narrow AI supports humans in their analysis, decision-making, and other tasks. In cases\nwhere tasks are well-specified and predictable, it can execute its functions without human\nintervention and with minimal supervision. Machine Learning can develop models and predictions that perhaps, given enough\ntime, humans could do. Deep Learning is different and can come up with solutions humans\nlikely would never think of. That said, Deep Learning typically uses artificial neural\nnetworks, themselves inspired by the way human brains work. Deep Learning is used\nfor some of the more complex human cognitive processes we take for granted, such as\nnatural language processing [ 30] and image recognition [ 31], and also for tackling complex\nproblems such as finding cures for intractable diseases [ 32] (see [ 9,21,25,33–35] for a general\nsummary of contemporary AI and HAT application areas).	Preamble	137	6	\N	\N	{}	[-0.037753973,-0.009990606,0.056231625,-0.016078718,0.029408323,-0.003977445,0.0033881713,0.06653765,-0.011212419,-0.01467251,-0.08569068,0.0022813843,-0.058317304,0.05608007,-0.048650496,-0.010374215,-0.01876381,0.017414242,-0.09744772,-0.029829489,0.015759295,0.08714135,-0.053585883,-0.03407173,-0.08767227,0.01636177,0.06168007,-0.09003123,-0.01192516,-0.020767407,0.095536955,-0.03323152,0.014335417,0.0007047752,-0.06260026,0.0692207,-0.1163352,0.04498251,0.026242688,-0.06100682,-0.0018537062,-0.048057195,0.023486631,0.05112052,0.13538408,0.012312898,-0.06003483,-0.055393692,0.0024996575,0.008927151,-0.065455996,0.011012357,0.022606738,0.071638644,9.335933e-05,-0.044444896,-0.025876448,-0.010472963,-0.055695362,0.042501975,0.058166746,-0.12784481,0.06561387,-0.03690807,0.0010435748,0.009303545,-0.015592967,-0.03120401,-0.008643768,-0.08215568,0.056814123,0.12313627,-0.02320751,0.02539434,0.0038068197,-0.0476233,0.0029745605,-0.048964895,0.10569612,-0.02552384,0.040939447,0.034731574,0.03802601,0.024308955,0.12836073,0.01528785,-0.03202053,0.010260628,-