966	8	47	The cooperation process\nfollows a directive approach. Cooperation does not imply a shared situation awareness\nbetween the end user and the AI-based system. Communication is not a paramount\ncapability for cooperation.\n• Collaboration Level 2B: collaboration is a process in which the end user and the AI-\nbased system work together and jointly to achieve a predefined shared goal and solve\na problem through a co-constructive approach. Collaboration implies the capability\nto share situation awareness and to readjust strategies and task allocation in real\ntime. Communication is paramount to share valuable information needed to achieve\nthe goal.	Preamble	97	5	\N	\N	{}	[-0.005978513,-0.039377704,-0.08975543,-0.07944175,-0.020697769,0.027773727,0.033711195,0.00028932095,0.01855215,0.018634558,-0.024019944,0.022393309,0.017025417,0.035627604,0.03169803,-0.025885481,0.056218512,-0.11157418,-0.07373932,-0.08040766,0.011986677,0.02443221,-0.027363893,0.026547888,-0.078073315,0.014898699,0.043745738,-0.06756969,0.0031964749,0.030574001,0.039723814,-0.020062417,0.052335847,0.009606785,-0.11198535,0.09646085,0.0022804306,-0.055141203,0.046818126,-0.090687,-0.081531025,-0.026938088,-0.08870958,-0.018329358,0.011237275,0.07749531,-0.06738099,0.017088378,-0.053121973,-0.019029612,-0.1128121,-0.023242118,0.015769681,0.015854118,0.09958763,0.079047956,-0.0119099235,0.00057303964,0.002784303,-0.0350018,-0.036276985,-0.025039377,0.01729164,0.007613952,0.08799218,-0.005552814,0.008663391,0.0072907875,-0.010716561,-0.06722531,0.045493994,0.050873693,-0.012269194,-0.04935181,-0.005896058,-0.014879155,-0.047169175,-0.017488703,0.030344727,-0.055180814,-0.006287802,0.10668005,-0.034443572,0.024660338,-0.0033635134,-0.112035155,-0.023471734,-0.0016327365,0.06917578,-0.015621937,-0.06872444,0.0024509204,-0.008735827,0.002542941,-0.0399178,-0.030923428,0.015251554,0.03627895,-0.039711047,-0.017132038,-0.011626572,0.023349855,-0.032441977,-0.07742094,-0.012495767,0.032789767,0.06