989	8	70	This section therefore details key milestones and themes in Human Factors over\nthe past 7 decades that have helped application domains such as aviation achieve and\nsustain very high levels of safety. These are the principal focal areas and capabilities of\nHuman Factors that need to be revisited (or even resurrected), reviewed, and updated\nin the context of AI, in order to form the basis of a Human Factors Requirements set for\nAI-based systems. Each milestone is outlined below, with one or more key references, along\nwith the implications for Human Factors assurance of future Human-AI Teaming systems\nin aviation.\n4.1.1.	Preamble	101	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.046492744,0.0043072994,-0.037714373,-0.0040538926,0.07649929,0.0477143,0.092514105,0.03037289,-0.09646596,0.053819682,-0.019788854,-0.038967945,-0.026534835,0.05264187,-0.021063615,0.023370923,0.03401662,-0.03503467,-0.10987359,-0.034436084,0.00028188445,0.0016298668,0.0058852998,0.0197306,-0.07801516,0.00018549061,0.009229051,-0.019558636,-0.041796364,-0.040144913,0.036220346,0.014086442,0.10414201,-0.0266832,-0.026539557,0.0139251035,0.010990863,-0.058420155,-0.0007981406,0.027225813,-0.09232305,-0.10565021,-0.0065149995,0.03616442,0.0025514148,0.05997625,-0.034723382,0.027862592,0.024692737,0.04511695,-0.079162784,0.02210967,0.04873186,-0.0577844,0.0593426,0.010384618,0.042603586,0.0009803291,-0.078742474,-0.035891317,-0.03916516,0.03496619,0.014089934,-0.0014215083,0.027289253,0.042543773,-0.07420247,-0.05476686,0.023032812,0.03488451,-0.021138525,-0.0024253759,-0.0041081016,-0.04251269,0.06314228,0.06540246,0.008440194,-0.08146525,0.02241802,0.015321356,0.06517773,-0.030225022,-0.059415586,0.07932568,0.021914782,0.017330991,-0.004568302,-0.045984413,-0.012915291,0.03133276,-0.06847061,-0.044340577,0.16367435,0.0019934033,0.035242897,0.04311855,-0.059987154,0.021152558,-0.034896445,-0.028803416,0.004995894,-0.00867913,0.021026725,0.08104007,-0.04666939,0.016454035,0.0892545,-0.03727011,0.047159024,-0.0542