997	8	78	Joint Cognitive Systems\nJoint Cognitive Systems (JCS) [ 53] and Cognitive Systems Engineering (CSE) [ 54]\nintroduced the concept of a cognitive system as an adaptive system that functions using\nknowledge about itself and the environment in the planning and modification of actions. CSE sought to side-step the man-vs machine paradigm and consider the cognitive output\nof both working together.	Preamble	60	2	\N	\N	{}	[0.0060461573,0.016557544,-0.044946134,-0.040085897,-0.0307263,-0.0065099336,0.050394256,0.050486527,0.024156477,0.07689413,-0.05324748,0.06699314,0.12707545,0.008437368,0.06555251,-0.045088347,-0.034614816,-0.03860006,0.021561783,-0.00900808,0.047583092,0.016960466,-0.060830873,-0.01652329,-0.08246098,0.049742676,-0.014673386,-0.023269814,-0.02784039,-0.009237928,0.05308301,0.021702694,0.075583816,-0.011551405,-0.018198859,-0.0070135132,0.05184039,-0.011460337,0.049179308,-0.057174116,-0.14296173,-0.00304349,0.012671862,-0.009969548,-0.035920814,0.08543775,-0.08686544,-0.07165127,-0.028873404,-0.0470444,-0.11496731,-0.021410508,0.04064146,-0.0066214213,-0.007236236,0.13374883,-0.015631817,0.036993183,-0.07177822,-0.03414147,-0.08987496,-0.08558535,0.035999175,0.048802745,0.031868085,0.023936944,-0.07273875,0.07479132,-0.01877104,-0.09623911,-0.019133203,0.005703419,-0.018331973,-0.024968129,0.010400084,0.03353575,-0.0474151,-0.060881007,0.048700403,-0.069365524,-0.017011523,0.07062753,-0.054460883,0.016009599,0.09141138,-0.005058613,-0.07875055,0.1023623,0.05837378,-0.017916754,-0.029141549,-0.17215565,0.037848208,0.0011631795,-0.025395945,0.0059442264,0.012268295,0.031351812,-0.050318908,0.015807386,0.046629403,0.030756308,0.059094965,-0.016230177,0.0336535,-0.012642163,0.047010962,0.088674076,0.1015364,-0.106299564,-0.03900311,-0.011885011,0.020832185,-0.033603325,-0.047549993,-0.005515842,0.016506491,0.07881708,0.09795513,-0.08224726,0.06310737,-0.021659696,0.07965171,0.013863591,0.058798105,-0.040348977,0.024972862,-1.6441184e-33,-0.092132