1008	8	89	However, the perception of what is\nhappening (and going to happen) to an object may be insufficient when the AI is processing\nits inputs; the human may need to understand what is behind the AI output. More recently, this delving into mental processes has focused on sense-making, which\nis the way people make sense out of their experience in the world [ 64]. Sense-making\ndeals with the human need to comprehend, often via the exploration of information. In\nrelation to AI, sense-making helps to test the plausibility of an AI’s explanations as well as\nanomalous outputs or event characteristics. Sense-making is a useful construct particularly\nin conditions where uncertainty is high and not all signals may be present, or where some\nsignals may be erroneous.	Preamble	125	5	\N	\N	{}	[0.028864508,-0.07049108,0.024071572,0.0104580615,0.10114023,-0.028682306,0.093546756,0.0046184114,0.07484993,0.02253463,-0.057721306,-0.057856523,0.011676919,-0.034111485,-0.007014711,-0.0018384397,0.04025621,-0.031989958,-0.104299165,-0.03929206,0.03919507,-0.082515016,-0.032901328,-0.060822252,-0.035071712,0.028699934,-0.036847666,-0.057018306,0.021139387,0.0037143573,0.07433649,0.0017854538,0.040760197,0.013777802,-0.020384565,0.09626368,-0.008822777,0.087996714,0.09490871,-0.0474145,0.0055294232,-0.020641929,-0.015871229,-0.02919314,0.08144513,0.041107792,-0.019111967,-0.010930607,0.01666214,-0.0085298605,-0.20887664,0.024510896,-0.047939114,-0.056175895,0.0198267,0.07485385,-0.059226528,0.032855406,-0.04815366,-0.051541895,0.007108978,-0.054643042,0.0645177,-0.03605652,0.04247031,0.013926367,0.010774124,-0.033808175,0.050830595,-0.010060195,0.06473684,0.120346345,-0.0038620643,0.00044976373,-0.023629103,0.049934614,-0.03802057,-0.020693798,0.0024693445,0.013822206,-0.011210328,0.04429974,-0.021100493,-0.024983095,0.040879875,0.016153434,0.011356034,-0.028828237,0.018676998,0.05167431,-0.07162164,-0.14329913,-0.07497998,0.054904822,0.10270991,0.080068044,-0.009572396,0.0329