1010	8	91	A critical question therefore becomes how to\ndevelop an interface and interaction means so that the AI and the human can remain ‘on\nthe same page’. Additionally, there will need to be operational explainability (OpXAI), so that the\nhuman crews can determine (i.e., make sense of) why a course of action has been recom-\nmended (or taken) by the AI. Such explainability needs to be in an operational context in\nlanguage that crews can follow (as opposed to data analytic explainability, which refers\nmore to how to trace an AI’s outputs to its internal architecture, data sources, and algorith-\nmic processes).	Preamble	101	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.043484878,-0.0179927,0.026753696,0.029334435,-0.032330133,-0.043870278,0.038505156,0.03967754,-0.012422258,0.024800712,-0.057522155,-0.02476322,0.02701811,0.016336957,-0.041341446,-0.024154486,0.061597336,-0.062060162,-0.022453662,-0.004333108,0.10267208,0.0044569615,0.001500677,-0.0460962,-0.12739566,0.052188132,0.043873187,-0.013898315,0.06091378,-0.019160371,0.0629782,0.04778451,0.07615061,-0.0061155567,-0.08486989,0.05165955,0.010965409,-0.022458658,0.057626594,-0.0421315,-0.064864144,-0.026707353,-0.015008911,-0.013529631,0.085994534,-0.086916335,-0.06301531,-0.030916251,-0.013860462,0.03328715,-0.1782185,-0.0059984513,0.0646284,-0.08900137,0.014297024,-0.015389958,-0.0066082026,0.055453938,-0.038567115,0.0038060544,-0.012457243,-0.0014500903,0.03801364,0.035257664,0.032522064,0.030306377,-0.0031370781,0.009442594,0.014169423,-0.01146998,-0.0020061897,0.03194773,-0.03923383,-0.047338407,-0.013906442,0.011053714,-0.028556552,-0.0031652872,0.019712394,-0.024637451,0.008454306,-0.0483869,0.02360242,0.034996476,0.007971671,0.0068912134,0.017829236,-0.020084793,0.00017160246,0.09996596,-0.03787287,-0.06804666,-0.04850173,-0.020158844,0.10237732,0.016123654,-0.0021499966,-0.059832726,-0.010152292,0.03903948,-0.021979976,-0.00530484,-0.002460402,-0.019167848,-0.060178824,-0.012116452,0.032781336,-0.07767962,-0.043331493,-0.065