1024	8	105	Teamwork and the Big Five\nAccording to the ‘Big Five’ theory of Teamwork [ 74], the core components of teamwork\ninclude team leadership, mutual performance monitoring, back-up behaviour, adaptability,\nand team orientation, which collectively lead to team effectiveness. These components\nare predicated on shared mental models, mutual trust, and closed-loop communication.	Preamble	51	2	\N	\N	{}	[0.020015843,-0.02616053,0.013719338,-0.041457504,0.06922599,-0.003310104,-0.0034249523,-0.061106443,0.058016058,0.010857162,-0.021705573,0.08459113,0.016975645,0.02795375,0.019756572,-0.097735435,-0.024694936,-0.03300801,-0.09819175,-0.095693775,-0.014228163,-0.08496457,-0.047616076,0.052073404,-0.028896704,0.006259844,-0.054351307,-0.0044266917,-0.056339122,-0.061212976,-0.044885594,0.012901186,0.0379717,0.0068583447,-0.10358221,0.11536539,0.041600253,0.05431453,0.024564477,0.018812923,-0.05497591,-0.058581207,0.023639604,-0.00034788842,-0.03121304,0.019977698,-0.009948301,-0.029051483,-0.07752522,-0.042997576,-0.09380816,-0.0436001,0.002893617,0.008090205,0.079337716,0.03882379,0.0020234168,-0.006988678,0.017875936,-0.015828114,-0.016939374,0.0018695935,-0.0032764212,0.046739347,0.033892028,0.02745177,-0.03658775,0.03346643,-0.05120325,-0.03522596,0.015816832,-0.07114604,0.0477464,-0.034704402,0.07829425,0.04868327,0.01351232,-0.10377156,0.079551406,0.0077503705,-0.06966327,0.042691194,0.0074444627,0.04624194,-0.056907713,-0.03951888,0.011299557,0.006785169,-0.025356103,-0.046131503,-0.051883996,0.037888378,-0.013473181,-0.017274365,-0.052955694,0.08702937,-0.003968617,-0.0042960458,-0.07086469,-0.03126158,0.035628043,-0.047354832,0.0025914258,-0.0078089028,-0.008690063,-0.022425009,0.080449656,-0.01955737,-0.0012991545,-0.00075981865,-0.0995176,0.040270157,-0.07814275,-0.008062498,0.026756011,-0.046606902,-0.039302185,0.09719133,-0.008554986,-0.009389828,0.09460286,-0.007420796,0.11898469,-0.0052650706,0.022342214,0.020525666,0.00093186885,-1.7375212e-33,0.000