1046	8	127	Goal awareness (a precursor to goal alignment) is a higher-level attribute, related\nto context awareness, and ensures that human and AI goals are aligned. This becomes\nimportant in work arrangement scenarios where the AI is able to modify the goal hierarchy,\nand where goals may dynamically shift during a scenario (e.g., for an emergency, as\nconditions worsen or become more stable). It can also be important where there are\na mixture of safety and other goals, some of which may conflict with safety.	Preamble	83	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.0004438214,0.012429371,-0.097184084,-0.034747243,0.0828478,0.026481576,0.085093945,0.03706519,0.05842792,-0.0005002542,-0.046832226,-0.006421039,0.055179667,-0.008296329,0.04746222,-0.046991657,-0.0017656673,0.011606273,-0.12502465,0.032582574,0.056722526,0.025920436,0.037650567,0.043591913,-0.09877122,0.061052386,0.030977473,-0.015712356,0.0021821542,0.025295045,0.07339085,-0.016115503,0.08066316,0.027495561,-0.0024535856,0.063881256,-0.003726757,-0.019751312,-0.007275553,-0.047493596,-0.07294043,-0.039598577,-0.05012858,-0.040191203,0.028198618,0.055927277,-0.019745005,0.006358219,-0.047745354,-0.024338504,-0.04609775,-0.057079557,-0.035263184,-0.037275698,0.06260937,0.13470341,0.01608896,-9.8288336e-05,-0.041829947,-0.043947738,-0.046540238,-0.09018741,-0.044245053,-0.004770062,0.063956834,-0.027902085,-0.028981922,-0.022142107,-0.015538061,0.012373485,0.029364252,-0.012189466,0.05721511,-0.020136936,0.0915647,0.010430996,-0.025877975,-0.039868247,-0.024983887,0.012050349,0.024032595,0.036872562,0.009383241,0.08059991,0.048384745,-0.003517609,-0.037192438,0.021591472,0.0495122,-0.009438823,-0.081906125,-0.12509346,0.009376192,0.022053512,0.0010324529,-0.0068382975,0.009898544,-0.050179936,-0.003652301,-0.04000795,-0.006057042,-0.019085033,-0.041260056,0.019187504,0.010003221,-0.032027457,-0.0382393,0.031739537,0.02638959,-0.027739326,-0.035173524,-0.0817341,0.031536695,-0.00074625463,-0.0087675005,0.003940355,-0.08048764,0.0415