1073	8	154	Communication—this area will no doubt evolve as HATs incorporate natural lan-\nguage processing (NLP), whether using pilot/ATCO ‘procedural’ phraseology or\nnatural language.\n5. Teamworking—this is possibly the area in most urgent need of research for HAT,\nin terms of how such teamworking should function in the future. For now, the\nrequirements are largely based on existing knowledge and practices.\n6. Errors and Failure Management—the requirements here focus on identification of AI\n‘aberrant behaviour’ and the subsequent ability of human end users to detect, correct,\nor ‘step in’ to recover the system safely.\n7.	Preamble	93	4	\N	\N	{}	[0.0018689691,0.007616838,0.038998347,-0.024110701,0.07421834,0.020213613,0.08001439,3.151775e-05,-0.032473415,0.009803375,0.009419649,-0.00055022864,0.046470318,0.017015414,0.008013367,-0.032865845,-0.046734963,-0.038160786,0.015492114,-0.06485141,0.0033475512,0.11586247,-0.03325266,0.0100357225,-0.03332376,0.01329657,-0.040730637,-0.041220505,-0.044331625,-0.0582744,-0.029967597,0.064705886,0.033688713,0.0930142,-0.045322217,0.087120295,0.043891504,0.08177855,0.034206707,-0.039857887,-0.10183657,-0.06426367,-0.023296652,0.0038427787,0.054261506,0.06099804,-0.07485426,0.013978414,-0.056209683,0.07489638,-0.0703819,-0.01017406,0.15264273,0.043083146,-0.004095702,0.073497474,0.009180134,0.039609835,0.006138869,-0.015311556,0.016958142,-0.029749094,-0.018121138,0.04246415,0.042052798,0.05610827,-0.011267111,-0.057487708,-0.0391416,0.024518302,-0.039812796,-0.02815872,-0.04970298,0.046379752,-0.046604346,0.124786474,-0.0006650758,-0.10616333,0.09046436,0.026874356,-0.09594586,0.03550583,0.045884006,0.058452975,-0.0036809873,-0.0012083846,-0.034542877,-0.00795038,-0.050738808,-0.03407421,-0.056165922,-0.027161863,0.10220859,0.011306879,0.060379647,0.09390826,-0.044984996,-0.036398176,-0.005761932,0.06954333,0.0011821687,0.014757627,0.0033438655,-0.09792339,-0.045139574,0.0024601014,0.06490404,-0.08683788,0.020655619,-0.03