1155	9	19	However, few studies have focused on the human’s cognitive changes related to this role change. In\naddition, few studies have focused on how to support the cognitive processes to aid human\nsupervisory performance in an autonomy context. To this end, this paper investigates how goals,\ndecision making, and information needs change and which requirement need to be set on the\ninformation provided by the autonomous system to support effective human oversight.\n1.4.	1. Introduction	72	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.04315525,0.005736405,-0.012892574,-0.08750453,0.039001215,-0.031427927,0.13075872,0.016772285,-0.018739508,0.063783176,-0.0024107457,0.03553925,-0.021926254,0.07883034,0.029886693,-0.052016653,0.09703865,-0.061975718,-0.10299763,-0.045860045,0.033000417,-0.087939516,0.010138741,0.0044648843,-0.116536155,0.014990046,-0.020013869,-0.095067404,-0.03342415,-0.029678445,0.010359035,-0.10882304,0.111976676,-0.037043393,-0.03150284,-0.01396827,0.064178266,0.043738354,-0.0044394517,-0.05957389,-0.04395138,-0.04238184,-0.03525022,0.0061547305,-0.014663187,0.07075028,-0.013866284,-0.07318476,-0.047918655,-0.05254694,-0.108720146,0.046097234,0.016201446,-0.069021605,-0.011024683,0.057418544,0.09459713,0.013187216,-0.010633705,-0.027566697,-0.026905123,-0.014646302,-0.021267226,0.009961707,0.02418463,-0.00849489,-0.030054012,-0.08591887,-0.010333156,-0.027660659,-0.018560104,0.001174125,0.010260663,-0.083657555,0.044622876,-0.032800615,-0.07803172,-0.02259103,0.06867943,-0.05319383,0.020554649,0.09725328,0.016342493,0.0772237,0.019864295,-0.025920387,-0.01901533,0.054809563,0.050045986,-0.0066140536,0.0070696613,-0.15478967,-0.0048525888,-0.04132429,-0.045761373,0.026383167,-0.019729191,0.035187017,0.017828621,0.008789171,0.025098423,-0.01626088,-0.05981185,-0.017137416,-0.011219948,0.09502133,0.06185848,0.011341902,0.021564756,-0.005018863,-0.032892145,-0.049757894,-0.030345643,-0.014519507,-0.026426338,0.0021349574,-0.02198517,0.10912546,-0.0052423696,-0.013265105,0.0737661