1166	9	30	For this study, the analysis focused on the general conduct\nof ships in any cases of visibility. The COLREGs describe, to a degree, the tasks to be performed in\nship-to-ship encounters. As such, the information already embedded in the rule descriptions was\nused to understand how navigators establish an awareness of the traffic, estimate safe speed,\ndetermine collision risk, and decide on which actions are needed to avoid collisions.	1. Introduction	69	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.058131047,0.0060913493,-0.017553871,0.030643584,0.05236267,-0.03857205,0.03210517,0.056501616,-0.09041358,0.038818266,0.027496563,-0.016584786,-0.011458068,0.039780978,-0.08643185,-0.019661732,0.06341743,0.032915786,-0.07600285,0.017919239,0.051423933,0.008446953,-0.028057426,-0.031188734,-0.13017453,-0.0021817365,0.06672478,-0.059606772,-0.034301788,-0.038516108,-0.039425615,0.017601911,0.03538337,0.05879454,-0.040559202,0.0040226392,0.060386345,-0.059200037,-0.021344205,0.002366543,-0.10819844,-0.015253185,-0.004369985,0.062458497,0.020513587,-0.075757824,0.041187212,-0.006131393,-0.012399504,0.020335045,-0.09989429,-0.06359816,0.0048018666,-0.04450503,0.048737403,-0.046541043,-0.03208962,-0.07617257,0.010669646,-0.03464199,0.03439968,-0.0040370994,-0.026267245,0.029045362,-0.0045730635,0.02978731,-0.0015105528,0.046298094,0.028176973,0.098944254,-0.011711883,0.038242217,0.026949748,0.011307234,0.029570717,-0.061210737,-0.039839197,-0.017445711,-0.013272226,-0.08934896,-0.012172792,-0.060905878,-0.03016676,0.032902606,0.037577704,-0.04276846,-0.03565693,0.06422396,0.015793702,0.070574075,-0.03033777,-0.09692349,-0.009630494,-0.046669587,-0.04107529,-0.029846638,-0.06733676,-0.036032222,0.07375019,0.008040167,0.0512217,0.015142085,-0.013105654,0.09583018,-0.044312246,0.04436806,0.02964395,-0.048964705,0.0023416942,0.026424907,-0.005823724,0.015930464,-0.03898288,0.0017386415,-0.09515204,0.0052814553,-0.032527406,-0.03387142,0.06538811,-0.062074766,0.06810294,-0.025515068,0.18556134,-0.00585