1200	9	64	Such deviations between system behaviour and the\nsupervisor’s expectations of the system’s behaviour may prompt a decision to intervene at own\ndiscretion. To make such decisions in an ever-changing context, and to intervene at any moment\nand at one’s own initiative, the supervisor needs to have appropriate SA based on access to\ncontinuous, sufficient, and relevant information (Endsley et al., 2003, Sher idan, 2002). This study\nhas made explicit which information elements would be needed to support supervisors performing\nthis task.\n4.2.	4. Discussion	82	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.05628854,0.040467754,-0.025844485,-0.020209251,0.045222484,0.025158443,0.037163746,0.048558667,-0.07322275,0.0625123,0.0012591569,0.03613002,-0.0156057775,0.04670931,0.016672714,0.0048300694,0.15292557,-0.058866438,-0.11561592,0.012019535,0.00038484667,-0.064824075,0.02089669,7.372232e-05,-0.10784446,0.0048776385,-0.0024052537,-0.07610203,0.019523121,0.0042174393,0.0016816643,-0.035706244,0.050351944,-0.023962215,-0.034711316,-0.0085216975,0.032911535,0.041999817,-0.023212753,0.0028138964,-0.03129706,0.020927545,0.022807704,0.028077634,-0.0010896405,-0.005423609,0.005336552,-0.050730903,-0.09310466,-0.046022248,-0.11006992,-0.02135008,0.024659425,-0.07121645,0.0018101641,-0.0047211507,0.056812745,-0.0031831954,0.03118921,-0.024589622,-0.03473637,0.0035275435,-0.037378,-0.018355178,0.041404426,0.07116927,-0.030392013,-0.0011120248,-0.023928337,0.044532157,-0.0049159597,0.013146493,-0.039453838,0.017310133,-0.00046736997,-0.08016987,-0.030718217,0.04891145,0.057753224,-0.0056007034,-0.04930246,0.06687636,-0.007861383,0.049557652,-0.024874145,-0.065542795,0.055131234,0.05577357,0.10833628,0.03631589,0.043649822,-0.049410556,0.0041085556,-0.055612367,-0.03535607,-0.009875032,-0.036891077,-0.09589574,-0.0073625264,0.033099797,0.039122425,0.0040106606,-0.008146696,0.005824396,-0.02203096,0.00471257,-0.062249605,-0.01917545,-0.0248437,0.08679481,-0.030496035,-0.023053698,-0.07953535,-0.07238135