1202	9	66	Earlier and ongoing research have explored the complexities\nof humans interacting with highly sophisticated automation in terms of human performance\n(Bainbridge, 1983, Endsley, 2017, Strauch, 2018). An intricate challenge exists in cases where\nhumans interact with systems to which more automation is added. The addition of automation adds\nto the overall reliability and robustness of the system, whilst the human’s ability to take over\nmanually decreases due to reduced SA. This “automation conundrum” and its effects need to be\nwell understood when d eveloping human-supervised CAGA systems in which humans take a\nmanagement-by-exception role (Endsley, 2017).	4. Discussion	96	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.030928131,-0.018554335,0.0013750682,0.007113741,-0.018208696,-0.047356527,0.095639884,0.010238819,-0.057135336,0.01138308,-0.025075825,-0.046454072,0.013591699,0.06267514,-0.028957486,-0.09233638,0.09919078,-0.06187359,-0.01587551,-0.024192221,-0.026650662,0.03323114,-0.011441214,0.050344177,-0.05949454,-0.041249,-0.04892986,-0.035140384,0.004766119,-0.01668508,0.015218049,-0.055931263,0.11895174,-0.00540092,-0.06632739,-0.028040307,0.03561227,-0.0016389316,0.0013952124,-0.1213557,-0.008758416,-0.11053415,0.017709836,0.051322337,-0.025406089,0.036870454,-0.06717762,-0.120853804,-0.061398327,-0.04526213,-0.11796379,-0.029598616,0.09941353,0.0055296114,-0.04020271,0.07217339,0.06460428,0.05112051,0.047114495,-0.048966195,0.017275017,-0.032914776,-0.027983254,0.060733616,0.09748112,0.026602268,-0.017190702,-0.09694843,0.028773649,0.03374566,-0.010744853,-0.009810328,-0.026524713,0.059386972,0.06520419,-0.012609247,-0.04258886,-0.107601315,0.104283564,-0.035611864,0.019169265,-0.016346158,-0.008175002,0.092254795,0.017190034,0.05139439,-0.049657088,0.06665937,0.00635918,-0.013052497,-0.02648822,-0.079795584,0.036438048,-0.020846419,-0.015809769,0.019011155,0.02883492,-0.0139867915,-0.030090528,-0.019645121,0.010117211,0.02188354,-0.055800624,-0.040165856,0.008025566,0.0132