1210	9	74	Therefore, to complement this work, future studies should extend this analysis to derive at\ncontext-specific requirements relevant for independent verification of CAGA system information\nand its intervention. This study has not explicitly addressed how to implement and operationalise the SA requirements\nin a practical human machine interface. Designing a human machine interface for supervising a\nCAGA system requires a structured, human centred, and iterative process (e.g., ISO, 2019), and was\noutside the scope of this study.	4. Discussion	76	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.05564622,0.024226027,-0.012360257,-0.0639171,-0.058419444,-0.048764784,0.05241343,0.025360188,-0.027343225,0.006235615,0.0059030796,-0.08116597,0.048621614,0.022646684,-0.015404895,-0.14330734,0.0711707,-0.07750364,0.027951619,-0.03817323,0.09851479,-0.0040945234,-0.042070266,-0.0065678377,-0.100384474,-0.058471337,0.0112923635,-0.019012377,0.06275642,0.0103903925,0.031550683,0.002558113,0.077002,0.017376132,-0.017834483,0.026573118,0.042104818,-0.07328297,-0.06829694,-0.08430393,-0.07051736,-0.0854635,0.054238144,0.07811068,0.07340666,0.026582537,-0.05387001,-0.08324263,-0.074747875,-0.0053118137,-0.04863006,-0.05571331,0.10978251,-0.021332325,-0.061278995,0.049914993,0.04653605,0.03757297,0.024244724,0.019374067,-0.0166788,-0.04163751,-0.07775702,0.029212724,0.07263086,0.06296266,-0.044603717,-0.083224386,0.04193832,0.010305838,-0.11716877,-0.060594283,0.017762624,0.03140154,-0.044547506,-0.028400471,-0.047938094,-0.04331087,0.09011907,-0.06225422,0.014960978,0.019051418,-0.011308971,0.04122164,0.049590442,0.04791344,-0.0015910171,0.039537083,-0.017467123,-0.034990814,0.052774034,-0.05902899,0.051970042,-0.052223805,0.048690576,-0.018059505,0.0028975622,-0.043750077,0.0029911336,-0.0050884723,0.007669395,0.028847862,-0.0060741105,0.013687375,0.026740244,0.06499493,-0.036208626,-0.013853313,-0.02033066,-0.013983761,-0.03356519,0.031239627,-0.07570566,-0.018365737,0.032587495,0.014979272,-0.01159190