1230	10	11	After an initial pilot test with four European air\ntrafﬁc providers, the approach was rolled out in 2005 and has gradually been applied across\nEurope. To date, 33 European member states have applied the approach, most of them\nmore than once. The EUROCONTROL Safety Culture Questionnaire has been scientiﬁcally\nvalidated [ 5,16] and positively reviewed by the European ANSPs [ 17]. It has also had more\nmodest applications in airlines and airports [18].\n1.4.	1. Introduction	74	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.052482374,0.0039115334,-0.10653332,-0.015896708,0.06569963,0.040438447,0.01870951,0.054570653,-0.05627164,0.02122807,0.05665269,-0.033023473,-0.019699035,0.026589269,-0.063303374,-0.032109816,0.023130216,-0.09241265,-0.059926532,0.0012453977,-0.054879438,-0.02066304,0.07446646,0.060302544,-0.06844895,-0.05146871,0.044953704,0.0014084372,0.04824969,0.029899746,0.034077734,0.094939634,-0.005395269,0.0044642617,-0.0046814033,-0.07435113,0.0021151586,-0.021853454,-0.06290335,0.041910302,-0.06409647,-0.120866336,-0.047680266,-0.034236223,0.033248622,0.0003192267,-0.037647367,0.056962203,-0.06804915,0.0119970115,0.040485628,-0.006749422,0.101077355,-0.07698253,-0.019780045,-0.048464984,-0.00071828294,0.043158587,-0.027918207,0.032812674,-0.04902003,0.030503415,-0.0751775,0.058901228,-0.012561009,0.065187626,-0.06474613,-0.120709844,0.053383082,-0.0347402,-0.15332201,-0.11525681,0.00014820127,0.09450218,0.04582057,0.106053285,0.023072537,-0.10129212,0.024363486,-0.062101386,0.105906956,-0.019727021,-0.011989657,-0.0025283066,0.107763514,-0.0091202045,-0.016438343,-0.043237194,0.03375981,0.042350784,0.054517213,-0.00018393683,0.026282717,-0.008416253,0.007056011,0.003185437,-0.05062424,0.050979238,-0.021235716,0.0035758582,0.027251264,0.025561074,-0.034985676,0.015896177,-0.09351438,-0.015866825,0.10556142,-0.06070186,0.055069197,-0.0072047063,-0.078760155,0.06509245,0.02133878,-0.10586751,0.013005213,0.0063665933,-0.007607705,-0.033057675,0.11612809,-0.005382771,0.008116105,