1263	10	44	The advantage of narrow AI is that it can focus on a speciﬁc\ndomain or even sub-domain for which there is sufﬁcient data for the AI to work, e.g.,\nhundreds of thousands of aircraft approaches by various aircraft to a particular airport\nrunway. An AI tool can then answer speciﬁc questions or ﬁnd solutions to problems, or\nsimply show how to optimize system performance based on a limited set of parameters for\nwhich there are plentiful data.	1. Introduction	77	2	\N	\N	{}	[0.03234128,-0.0051344126,0.003325902,0.02053247,0.054860655,0.00045424703,0.00038042088,0.06879367,-0.0010865366,0.020328235,-0.07830625,-0.0477978,-0.035739362,-0.034988873,0.0022347167,0.055072606,0.062396202,-0.055433538,-0.09767147,-0.08637725,0.06582567,-0.008185995,-0.07946286,-0.066576846,-0.0964063,0.06313209,0.072832614,-0.045057975,0.019613715,-0.02355682,0.0586115,0.05931672,-0.0002281515,-0.023599846,-0.019524422,0.02094767,-0.07578262,0.067622,0.07653833,0.01603912,-0.025659736,0.037321836,0.04086642,-0.020394279,0.056480844,0.027048133,-0.06470689,-0.035946347,0.04642652,-0.01012907,-0.07178491,-0.02957911,0.010135066,-0.009653825,0.01953555,-0.020827547,-0.03800744,0.020268515,-0.02270761,0.03571716,0.018363668,-0.08065765,0.09079933,-0.0498788,0.042497307,-0.03347935,-0.010083227,-0.013001036,-0.042327564,-0.05771337,0.012669655,0.0830077,-0.044282466,0.030583547,0.056852266,-0.039430477,0.011361521,-0.03928523,0.03942149,-0.04522619,0.038894307,0.033081543,-0.03346977,0.06901368,0.047439992,0.0004187455,-0.0068707997,-0.09657567,0.059841122,0.023731487,0.08348541,-0.08076991,0.049862247,-0.0068972283,0.062408727,-0.016289122,0.0006071365,-0.041090213,-0.002783079,0.045800943,0.01758161,0.028307732,0.041820183,0.0013217102,0.004592912,0.030583162,0.13001737,-0.028336056,0.08814564,-0.06970641,-0.04443514,0.00039809526,0.003572348,-0.036121663,-0.012314207,-0.087447435,-0.00620339,0.032266583,-0.015196947,0.010247689,-0.12413738,-0.05288203,0.03170854,0.09810139,0.082493,