1280	10	61	At this level, humans and AI collaborate,\nand each can act independently to a certain extent. This differs from what we have today,\nand could affect safety culture if safety became the province of the AI, rather than the\nhuman. There are currently no AI systems in aviation that autonomously share tasks with\nhumans, or can negotiate, make trade-offs, change priorities, or start and execute tasks\nunder their own initiative.	1. Introduction	70	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.054684576,-0.052059293,-0.07061448,-0.021620426,0.046170227,0.014039916,0.030735442,-0.008225687,0.003071698,0.08133802,-0.013832579,0.016018681,-0.029978713,0.05129862,0.011036465,-0.041959286,-0.01894108,-0.057495687,-0.110355884,0.0019380739,-0.031647265,0.050372534,-0.025515782,0.040867817,-0.093540035,0.00951951,0.06348187,-0.05354747,-0.006175602,-0.032849323,0.078267805,-0.089721486,0.12669104,0.032254513,-0.05125926,0.020561527,-0.027298018,-0.03482628,0.07357983,-0.03431864,-0.105605066,-0.08116368,-0.06899215,-0.016391018,-0.023968164,0.08235287,-0.09462022,-0.03984169,0.009206931,0.016292684,-0.08856462,0.03308294,0.06944803,-0.037966985,0.038107194,0.03334365,0.007023186,0.00891695,-0.044276245,-0.0699869,-0.044257324,0.006358481,0.07528229,0.013178836,0.114145026,0.03732361,-0.042131875,-0.0066013183,0.031045655,-0.060515914,0.031260006,0.034898523,0.04337155,0.019951876,0.03220608,0.029413568,0.019120978,-0.03824614,0.021033682,-0.039475475,0.023032479,-0.011082001,0.0047393534,0.06867784,0.031234037,-0.010772147,-0.08009221,0.02952294,0.0671097,-0.024981998,-0.13424344,-0.029314479,0.12583867,-0.045639545,0.056187395,0.044204064,-0.00903009,0.017712547,-0.013215289,-0.037270892,-0.015136564,0.0040022316,-0.051808663,0.006189659,0.021709358,0.071796395,0.042809367,-0.11018981,0.04446531,-0.02992964,-0.06801972,0.019604309,0.017739803,-0.037923906,0.00952996,-0.013110928,-0.062074125,0.04999053,0.036178708,-0.025323067,-0.05663864,-0.048415076,0.09419454,0.0593305,0.097575806,-0.01780742