1309	10	90	There are two aspects to this issue,\none philosophical, the other more practical. The philosophical question is whether an AI,\nin the distant future, could have sentience. This remains too speculative an issue at this\ntime, and so is left to other authors, as the focus of this paper is on narrow AI. Sentience\nwould only likely become plausible with artiﬁcial general intelligence (AGI), which does\nnot yet exist, though it may well do in the next decade [43].	1. Introduction	79	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.042743277,-0.035729557,0.038964137,0.04660765,0.025664,-0.020691423,0.020967072,0.001417122,-0.018457493,0.06408154,-0.038356837,-0.008533795,-0.02587942,0.020424115,0.021098461,0.014380647,0.015844533,-0.09377574,-0.042123623,-0.039074697,-0.030350149,0.07626087,-0.025434092,-0.05591847,-0.08098128,-0.008753659,0.051887557,-0.116880685,-0.04818887,-0.0020796687,0.061882474,0.05527575,0.03266505,-0.018890636,-0.03644323,0.05998938,-0.075189166,-0.01823784,0.11055618,-0.09945663,0.036019947,-0.018033272,-0.0011169648,0.02218149,0.06548906,-0.0095907375,-0.022235453,-0.02180679,-0.08979661,-0.025959317,-0.102485836,-0.020517182,0.057274632,-0.048093546,-0.008175797,-0.047273483,-0.007791851,0.0048639784,-0.03363805,-0.0045952452,0.015240216,-0.029008616,0.101326965,-0.04762296,0.0567569,0.03387457,-0.011975884,-0.05431925,0.029545607,-0.07053532,0.117353655,0.0724134,0.028344382,-0.0796143,0.037490264,-0.0002841672,0.008857945,-0.020760404,0.067453705,0.006825892,-0.04348837,0.010410687,-0.021700663,0.05213013,-0.021034192,-0.008917328,0.011954019,0.0020814727,-0.007659276,-0.0010619758,0.020060925,-0.09105716,-0.019198874,0.006925183,0.055199485,0.03273641,-0.050493162,-0.036659904,-0.03201752,0.039499674,0.024529498,0.07642095,-0.06712792,0.013909773,0.022818195,0.021976113,0.08303426,-0.12257944,0.031452317,-0.038687017,-0.0456652,-0.04142651,0.11759008,0.01860546,-0.024767693,-0.0591542,-0.008716477,0.07415238,0.03685178,-0.009661211,-0.020184075,0.0013219821,0.