1294	10	75	This deﬁnition emphasizes that actions, omissions, or decisions taken by aviation\nprofessionals should be commensurate with their experience and training. This raises a\nkey question: what formal training on AI/Machine Learning (ML) and its state-of-the-art\nalgorithms should aviation professionals receive? A vast range of potential failure modes\nexist for ML systems [ 38], which does not include potential failure modes for future AI\nsystems.	1. Introduction	64	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.0048063085,-0.02757876,0.03205998,0.0530501,0.05249805,0.023293816,0.038496207,-0.035951752,-0.071181506,-0.0028768468,-0.062120132,0.0087163625,-0.019779367,-0.0008420888,-0.021944668,0.061056644,-0.020626826,-0.036287848,-0.01438857,-0.018264659,0.037074253,0.079854995,-0.04766972,0.07234684,0.015582604,0.03387096,0.052291818,-0.02481946,-0.017655106,-0.018156,0.03267616,0.0010427164,0.04498519,0.05896131,-0.028769715,0.013213723,-0.0045399577,-0.007460555,0.037858043,-0.032360826,-0.051277123,-0.030111458,0.0073821987,-0.03581952,0.06124204,0.046651866,-0.03355288,-0.07402349,-0.015246027,0.022662679,-0.09017531,-0.07804586,0.037573703,0.0066789296,-0.0037705097,-0.022082424,-0.015511447,0.05826414,-0.041018702,-0.027290156,-0.01654699,-0.02023952,-0.027512988,-0.013423694,0.022433916,0.0121404575,-0.04019567,-0.056991305,0.04783145,-0.033377793,-0.07236347,0.009157628,-0.059438877,0.093603015,-0.020142628,0.035304934,0.03735143,-0.0421643,0.009620556,0.019785356,-0.008751324,-0.0048735347,-0.05296853,0.05319795,0.044994775,-0.068923414,-0.050912753,-0.0023721673,0.034445334,-0.020940997,-0.036043484,-0.038986016,0.019094303,-0.030111324,0.051324457,0.08747122,-0.03026852,-0.07636453,-0.025395859,0.053650588,-0.029549552,0.033891425,-0.0037983244,0.0034125359,-0.014537866,0.032509804,0.064211614,-0.08425176,0.095290154,-0.07906915,-0.022231653,0.027710296,0.023752255,-0.07345785,-0.0004558661,0.102533154,-0.0741175,0.014063577,-0.010452914,0.08012369,-0.115388036,-0.017090447,0.