1299	10	80	The problem with human-AI teaming and just culture is not simply a moral one. If\naviation professionals are concerned about their accountability regarding AI, they will\nbe reluctant to use it, or err on the side of caution, e.g., always agreeing with the AI if\nthe situation is not clear-cut.	1. Introduction	50	2	\N	\N	{}	[0.07742024,0.021112252,-0.042887688,-0.021200845,0.018595869,0.036393486,0.03402384,-0.004859325,-0.007257647,0.044690426,0.0009569777,-0.0017639429,-0.07242072,0.056315597,0.024648787,0.010532706,-0.044292964,-0.03792379,-0.06420709,-0.009189424,-0.057551656,-0.0034776179,-0.0013625011,0.03774502,-0.0045894864,-0.043040734,0.08051038,-0.039668363,0.0043401006,-0.008300294,0.011110117,0.04134405,0.08547387,0.043975078,-0.06264166,0.043722298,-0.029263042,-0.0072370567,0.04993884,-0.0316314,-0.018825395,-0.07044684,-0.004043203,-0.049582798,-0.0238562,0.04738656,-0.046383783,-0.006874319,-0.0039049748,0.009528858,-0.044354923,-0.020366097,0.06566249,-0.090870105,0.0327987,-0.00010799507,0.019177783,0.0017064865,-0.01710926,-0.0405941,0.003768834,-0.0008963942,0.052527174,0.013419958,0.022744145,0.07188782,-0.017608609,-0.007062719,-0.025129339,-0.011482347,0.041302025,-0.017358169,0.05320303,0.01339801,0.019945662,0.10512587,0.0152601125,-0.042198393,0.08494276,-0.03667268,0.06745953,-0.030117026,-0.039906316,0.0251847,0.020430336,-0.053100288,-0.020409534,-0.052243806,0.07018496,0.053466987,-0.081612945,-0.010084897,0.13946947,-0.064603806,0.05096043,0.119145185,-0.04305283,0.038600296,-0.055629265,-0.015738046,0.027033674,0.041161332,0.003328577,-0.0068137147,-0.04572351,0.046381813,0.07412197,-0.09010685,0.043061227,-0.057945598,-0.047798958,0.08446303,0.00069269433,-0.029296782,0.042943634,0.042920053,0.0025880586,0.08265363,0.0068859374,-0.06277524,-0.059592653,-0.045438666,0.065184474,0.117191136,0.14522979,-0.03480662,-0.031724058,-2.0020445e-33,-0.06812131,-0.0018155071,-0.022090094,-0.028157856,0.024436306,-0.074133664,-0.0592