1306	10	87	Whereas an AI can be deﬁned according to\nits function (what it does) and/or its mechanism (how it achieves it), humans are deﬁned\naccording to agency by what they want to achieve (their goals and motivations), as well as\ntheir capabilities and limitations. People need to feel autonomous (able to self-regulate their actions and experiences\naccording to their interests and values), competent, and related (socially connected) to\nfunction in the world. This is self-determination theory.	1. Introduction	75	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.029580208,-0.03428168,-0.029490594,-0.008692035,0.026648508,-0.017599221,0.063941516,0.07406609,0.040546477,0.011061643,-0.03044255,-0.0015875835,-0.0036434187,-0.013174002,0.037455257,-0.028386978,0.048909795,-0.068058096,-0.07449124,-0.021206152,0.04144798,-0.025707059,-0.11087266,-0.030749684,-0.068139434,0.07589685,0.010306985,-0.07631643,0.025558122,0.005742106,0.06413062,-0.054321364,0.08438007,-0.010025877,-0.042375054,0.039610345,-0.03521805,-0.036680326,0.07457309,-0.030564327,0.014319567,-0.04182503,0.018370548,-0.081356436,0.09077108,0.09554197,-0.09366614,-0.0350218,-0.027496656,-0.020357229,-0.07862941,0.07589753,-0.007959315,-0.0130024655,-0.021568501,0.050211694,0.04643754,0.03117138,-0.017331202,-0.013247658,0.084005296,-0.058308266,0.09004355,0.070673026,0.11206917,0.01449361,0.037296355,-0.058761787,-0.0027841704,-0.08292086,0.08149336,0.028617935,0.020781742,0.011568371,0.06406101,-0.04134185,-0.018161155,-0.03948525,0.06492755,0.034311987,-0.0100183105,0.0495468,0.05239604,0.049743112,-0.06588593,-0.0006276176,0.017975058,-0.062828824,0.035469506,0.0017087748,-0.032481283,0.006991976,-0.057459533,-0.014888967,0.031004159,0.015199756,0.02290418,-0.01914283,-0.02223128,-0.01339107,-0.058920275,0.028260225,-0.09224058,0.013069318,-0.0006877531,0.00769386,0.04301287,-0.05467447,0.05617517,-0.011771123,-0.08736011,-0.072091185,0.064174,-0.026265696,0.102406636,0.0054155155,-0.044562254,0.09047552,0.06939147,-0.017845524,-0.0