1307	10	88	According to [ 42], this links to\npeople’s personal identity (how one feels about oneself) and their social identity (how\nsociety thinks about you and the group you belong to), for example, “I am competent as a\npilot (or air trafﬁc controller, or engineer, etc.), and pilots are useful in the world”. Taking\naway the human’s perception of identity and role can negatively affect self-determination. This may be expected to degrade safety culture, as the human’s role in the system’s overall\n‘safety space’ (the hypothetical landscape of all safety functions and activities) diminishes.\n2.11.	1. Introduction	94	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.044461176,0.06687991,-0.054292634,-0.029925754,0.09587493,-0.016372398,0.18872425,0.05324808,-0.007419844,-0.0045767776,0.045349535,-0.015487934,0.01720007,-0.05829993,-0.03642236,-0.03713226,0.019682322,-0.003995659,-0.116320536,0.034581453,-0.060513742,0.026461435,0.0041700313,0.07567274,-0.109531656,-0.032842558,0.038190257,0.02410457,-0.028817534,-0.0071189986,0.028675333,-0.0034997028,0.08702788,0.00031531538,-0.03661321,-0.021564588,0.054683927,0.007417812,-0.0014190567,-0.054735597,-0.06278416,-0.0927098,-0.0048856484,0.0063717477,-0.011977862,0.010230394,0.040225714,-0.023363011,0.00035330106,-0.03107373,-0.00924687,0.051632717,0.00346482,-0.062475145,0.0696049,-0.025677899,0.019650608,0.052495576,-0.06538606,0.07847621,0.040164802,-0.03530087,0.010218283,0.045554776,0.09001725,0.021367399,-0.021891449,-0.043285638,0.016594969,-0.032790028,-0.042401418,-0.02712701,0.06145407,0.0044296593,0.05433776,8.2176026e-05,0.009821274,-0.073897325,0.0337782,0.024204573,0.0815127,0.06587531,-0.005778563,0.046552837,-0.027889922,0.0035330465,-0.03627588,-0.021995666,-0.028684715,0.025214428,-0.12757154,-0.069047086,0.11117695,-0.033785544,0.017998148,-0.013541276,-0.025008488,0.018797304,-0.014793418,-0.019504396,0.0053174896,0.011486679,-0.018480368,0.07731165,-0.010097691,0.014455436,0.023644092,-0.037843775,-0.024254214,0.001475763,-0.066