1365	10	146	Safeguards and Organizational Risk Owners\nThe analysis above has raised a number of potential threats to safety culture, and\na more or less equivalent number of ‘safety culture affordances’ wherein safety culture\ncould be enhanced. In this sense, the overall impact of AI and human-AI teaming on safety\nculture will depend on how it is researched, designed, developed, deployed, and managed\nin actual operational environments. The issues identiﬁed, whether positive or negative,\ncan lead to safeguards to prevent safety from being diminished because of the introduction\nof advanced AI systems into aviation. However, for safeguards to be effective, those who\ncan enact them also need to be identiﬁed.	4. Results	108	4	\N	\N	{}	[0.03078456,0.02358953,-0.07030219,-0.016568633,0.06475279,0.055091143,0.07634769,0.028841468,-0.013533971,0.024756327,0.010801746,-0.0324002,0.06859631,0.00718537,-0.009687967,-0.021375509,0.010959024,-0.03017443,-0.1104909,-0.0035175236,-0.037346352,-0.018793179,-0.015337663,0.03838548,-0.13746543,-0.025694048,0.036139105,0.04166753,0.0020689056,-0.02015983,0.003692655,-0.028641406,0.092328615,0.029704107,-0.036153316,0.025637394,-0.025550986,-0.012945413,0.051423755,-0.01049839,-0.102478705,-0.07167286,-0.011658337,-0.039213143,-0.020039823,0.04308425,-0.011022537,-0.018331872,-0.00484819,-0.018897386,-0.03256997,0.0043512387,0.06053509,-0.05566416,0.0022901862,-0.022936448,0.03617148,-0.025097886,-0.086876325,-0.0019194519,0.02096476,-0.011695139,0.019949572,0.0027346641,0.03495509,0.034451354,-0.09714716,0.029003201,0.02271873,0.02504016,0.026186695,-0.027941532,0.035803583,0.0019481516,0.0014426415,0.09769437,-0.026207322,-0.055636276,0.035851162,-0.056547027,0.09484906,-0.004625697,0.03669154,0.07393698,-0.026191818,0.06180264,0.0052622966,-0.03249278,0.07272029,0.05066705,-0.07297769,-0.05715696,0.14511465,0.007156793,0.09047364,0.0338734,-0.0666223,0.016276168,-0.051222865,-0.04574242,0.050578974,0.02270658,0.0007557921,0.05