1388	10	169	Human factors have a key role to play in the development of human-AI teaming [ 53],\nespecially if such systems are truly intended to be human-centric. This will require\nco-development work between human factors practitioners/researchers and data\nscientists/AI developers, so that the human—who after all literally has ‘skin in\nthe game’—is always fully represented in the determination of optimal solutions\nfor explainability, team-working, shared situation awareness, supervised learning,\nhuman-AI interaction means and devices, and training strategies. Several new re-\nsearch projects are paving the way forward.	4. Results	86	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.0073346896,-0.005869743,0.0029845464,0.01736802,0.100892246,-0.0123219965,0.066172644,0.00017543226,-0.07030605,0.008210938,-0.04200419,-0.04695122,-0.008510733,0.065460555,0.063948855,-0.04605297,-0.0012862879,-0.011515421,-0.007035575,-0.06753193,-0.028708763,-0.065017566,-0.011783066,-0.052917007,-0.055322874,-0.020672392,0.005637572,-0.0768777,-0.036435366,-0.031367704,0.009161307,0.014572338,0.07784205,-0.006199943,-0.057783373,0.10146118,-0.0039090095,0.008065947,-0.0009967914,0.02977821,-0.07668704,-0.06544522,-0.022174055,0.013759224,0.06617707,0.07349366,-0.04501882,-0.005953231,-0.009508014,0.014573932,-0.07018375,-0.040718272,0.036453206,-0.061752193,0.054370593,0.045963313,0.07228211,0.0068612345,0.005872721,-0.022257524,0.017606713,-0.032162767,0.029151062,-0.02346404,0.07866121,-0.023767315,0.031793643,0.023992857,-0.004680022,-0.013402942,0.040636797,0.0089316135,-0.034319237,-0.089025944,0.08619906,0.10309357,-0.040508173,-0.05480439,0.047262523,0.0013032551,-0.0016149417,-0.029189015,-0.007804729,0.08000886,0.020355547,-0.027638888,-0.011550412,-0.030059444,-0.0030173974,0.029493406,-0.05748043,0.0024020912,0.07496177,-0.009711418,-0.0222379,0.053138472,-0.008811494,0.045184273,-0.03285859,-0.019767506,-0.05628419,0.00038400723,0.007679335,0.0149509255,-0.015979728,0.009865123,0.019077335,0.00493988