1399	11	2	Based\non the ODD description, conflict scenarios are generated and\ntested in a simulation environment, showcasing situations inside\nand outside the ODD. Based on these results, the feasibility\nof using ODDs in ATC is discussed, outlining a potential step\ntowards the safe application of Human-AI Teaming.\nIndex Terms —Operational Design Domain, AI Engineering,\nHuman-AI Teaming, Air Traffic Control\nI. I NTRODUCTION\nAdvances in Artificial Intelligence (AI) propel promising\nreal-world applications in aviation applications [1]. Therefore,\nthe European Union Aviation Safety Agency (EASA) updated\nits AI Roadmap along with the concept paper for level 1&2\nmachine learning applications [2], [3].	Preamble	99	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.046630565,-0.024819752,-0.041097954,0.035694905,0.08093526,0.010587841,0.035623435,0.0017777982,-0.024678186,0.04134447,-0.08598128,-0.036676146,-0.006393818,-0.012737506,-0.011028934,0.042912416,0.011876805,-0.044724442,-0.034430042,0.005091216,0.001147897,-0.0139730675,-0.05295741,0.01824865,-0.016970823,-0.05851133,0.03583298,0.049672134,-0.041482218,-0.043680377,0.05834165,-0.041219577,0.071964934,0.021194564,-0.03899741,-0.01672079,-0.028893476,-0.020136956,0.03783858,-0.017467635,-0.062358577,-0.08812523,-0.01153899,-0.037802592,0.025420886,0.099998266,-0.042595,0.017929662,-0.014878457,0.021576595,-0.059712093,-0.006704285,0.037096083,-0.07530623,0.0008182583,0.016199755,-0.018214373,-0.0037812472,-0.052039456,-0.007669163,-0.022888975,-0.016687311,0.008813806,0.008479084,-0.0025461367,-0.0045223525,-0.010632083,0.057790685,0.03292268,-0.03916119,0.01617815,0.028173503,-0.015319464,0.007399547,0.114163116,0.08968842,-0.008636229,-0.056681816,0.08091122,-0.029070584,-0.011622411,-0.052470054,-0.031353183,0.0472831,0.032975078,-0.041143462,-0.03767842,0.02321781,0.053166423,0.040951595,-0.05569593,0.031920616,0.19303094,-0.013355987,0.047506366,0.10274996,-0.030473635,-0.0008269199,-0.04595618,0.009067352,-0.021380348,-0.002362606,