1401	11	4	This\nis in line with the findings from other work [5], which asked\nexperts from different industries about the practical reality\nand feasibility of Human-Autonomy Teaming. To provide\nconstraints and requirements for safety assurances, EASA\nsuggests the transfer of the concept of Operational Design\nDomains (ODD) from the automotive field based on the\nSociety of Automotive Engineers (SAE) J3016 [2], [3], [6]. The ODD is intended to describe the conditions under which\na given AI-based system is designed to function [7]. In this work, both Human-AI Teaming and the concept\nof ODD are applied in the field of Air Traffic Control\n(ATC). Currently, Air Traffic Controllers (ATCOs) collaborate\nin teams due to the paramount importance of safety, as\nerrors in human judgment can result in severe consequences. Anticipated increases in air traffic and the corresponding\ndemand for controllers are likely to lead to a shortage of\nATCOs in the near future.	Preamble	151	5	\N	\N	{}	[-0.038312625,-0.031463318,-0.08558634,0.0074690627,0.054758564,-0.042489015,0.060586855,0.075935654,0.014260482,0.066590115,-0.017477624,0.016934615,0.02831645,-0.030269852,-0.014589817,-0.0026014491,0.094428375,-0.07877062,-0.0451875,-0.0020978423,0.031817947,0.00895998,-0.025313523,-0.016420472,-0.12302694,-0.045392,-0.018664103,-0.015570513,-0.025931617,-0.0933577,0.058079626,-0.0006074718,0.098151185,-0.02638176,-0.04264559,-0.0057402463,0.012068823,0.016835418,0.0502433,-0.05755249,-0.118433945,-0.13183288,-0.0004917746,0.00088138354,-0.04720261,0.029111547,-0.0258502,-0.021011915,0.039005753,-0.016048951,0.026886784,0.018759446,0.002457467,-0.09134443,0.0063998727,0.02030191,-0.043411087,0.0055136983,-0.06617034,-0.0010921219,-0.027048187,0.039712656,-0.021185363,0.031105896,-0.0017521725,0.029080804,0.019306721,-0.035240907,0.013760157,-0.02543135,-0.0040626726,-0.05027771,0.022026684,-0.005078569,0.1493223,0.084456615,0.026896939,-0.026558708,0.023797307,-0.08121095,0.051345624