1403	11	6	The project\nLOKI (Collaboration of Aviation Operator and AI systems)1\nat the German Aerospace Center (DLR) intends to enable\nthe AI-based system to handle chosen flights autonomously\nwithin a given sector. This process involves the intentional\ndelegation of aircraft control to an AI-based digital team\npartner, emphasizing a human-centered approach to aviation\noperations collaboration. Once an aircraft is delegated to the\nsystem it also performs safety-critical tasks, such as conflict\ndetection and conflict resolution (CD&R). To introduce a\nfallback solution, the system needs the possibility to re-\ndelegate such safety-critical tasks back to the human controller. However, the decision when to re-delegate a task from the\nAI-based digital team partner back to the human requires an\n1https://www.dlr.de/de/me/forschung-und-transfer/projekte/loki\nexact definition under which conditions this is necessary to\nhappen.	Preamble	127	5	\N	\N	{}	[-0.04589251,-0.02037413,-0.06937295,-0.056857824,0.007927976,0.002325777,0.044119615,0.014072166,0.0588121,0.085179456,-0.0019645647,0.020328982,0.005777547,0.033395745,0.006426843,-0.019584628,0.017420389,-0.109062314,-0.067039534,-0.02807835,0.025261324,-0.02277878,-0.056135736,0.002239744,-0.05955289,-0.0616115,0.011787574,-0.13257667,-0.01779318,-0.0677403,0.027398473,-0.0550878,0.0020373731,-0.032177616,-0.06365489,0.08400364,0.0050776973,-0.02789928,-0.027607074,-0.0551741,-0.105927765,-0.04374964,-0.046221416,-0.010534609,-0.040660437,0.06394406,-0.05596602,0.027221017,-0.0046128547,0.017436873,-0.011337723,0.014557576,0.029492611,0.004779972,0.07129759,0.028361633,0.039644044,0.059614196,-0.044034556,-0.03062546,-0.020830208,0.010698137,0.0015759349,0.027085712,0.014317873,0.017943738,0.022627406,-0.037076257,-0.03553662,-0.02346353,-0.021801053,-0.0026085202,0.0016678781,0.023013825,0.07646702,-0.020282842,-0.011533057,-0.017099174,0.07275219,-0.043384276,0.08734681,0.060573503,-0.0650474,0.074046716,0.01