1404	11	7	Information on the conditions is not only required\nfor safety aspects but also for the end user, the ATCO, to\nunderstand the capabilities and limitations of the AI-based\ndigital team partner as well as to build appropriate levels of\ntrust in the automation. In this paper, the aforementioned concept of ODDs is\nadapted from the automotive field and applied to the interaction\nbetween human controllers and the AI-based digital team\npartner in the field of ATC.	Preamble	76	2	\N	\N	{}	[-0.08724415,-0.01044842,-0.08404896,-0.027309231,0.0099421395,0.022311524,0.05011152,0.053804863,0.06320454,0.05410432,0.0040534697,-0.015660401,0.100496575,-0.018804299,-0.009514541,-0.04626344,0.06872374,-0.10981153,-0.07050094,-0.0023664788,-0.008647698,-0.07049223,-0.053081907,-0.03470581,-0.032286935,-0.09169573,0.010049363,-0.0024206787,-0.067682825,-0.040571094,-0.06470293,-0.036612924,0.11205876,-0.014731048,-0.028810414,-0.08767614,-0.031501304,-0.0043722815,-0.0142589435,-0.12182341,-0.060775436,-0.106209345,-0.0077666077,0.0040337765,-0.0017620227,0.080424614,0.0062473086,0.010421889,0.025465393,0.01440347,-0.08017434,0.011284508,0.05488484,-0.046978045,-0.061541732,0.051252045,0.00023579613,-0.0044681295,-0.010528913,-0.00059345964,0.06566128,0.0009110907,-0.024453523,0.046881665,0.02920581,0.019801712,-0.008509772,0.011363477,-0.012869249,-0.0594195,0.03908924,-0.033406027,0.016672164,-0.007792942,0.066224545,-0.0515737,-0.035449214,-0.09354777,0.080738105,-0.049252644,0.0020435562,-0.019245759,0.01641244,0.019491605,-0.057451896,0.013291155,-0.0026068597,0.057942558,0.066585645,0.019615173,-0.02802284,-0.02357059,0.034527853,-0.030258125,0.067328185,0.07554288,0.011804834,-0.020464921,-0.019098539,-0.028396895,-0.033814434,-0.037651256,-0.04890771,-0.034173924,0.048106927,0.09391984,0.071762666,-0.09958318,0.07237691,-0.01943294,-0.009088499,0.00797622,0.028297298,-0.025721846,-0.04358182,-0.030419009,-0.09863839,0.09187245,0.03559746,-0.07216722,0.018751362,-