1408	11	11	R ELATED WORKS\nIn the following, background information and related\nwork are outlined on the aspects of Operational Design\nDomain, Single Controller Operation, Conflict Detection and\nResolution, and finally on Human-AI Teaming in Air Traffic\nControl.\nA. Operational Design Domain\nThe application of (semi-)autonomous cars is one prominent\nexample of an autonomous system operating in a challeng-\ning real-world environment. Safety is a key aspect of this\ntechnology influencing either the success or failure of an\nAI-based system. However, applying safety measures on an\nAI-based system with black-box-like behavior is a challenging\nengineering task.	Preamble	94	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.0003215602,0.014547499,-0.08078877,0.035032816,0.04874007,-0.0017864864,0.049809728,0.059503302,-0.02790309,0.03395709,-0.06280812,-0.009274151,-0.0067084604,-0.035575885,-0.051584307,0.0039171316,0.04595245,-0.023050487,-0.09772593,-0.02436666,0.061083198,0.03808441,0.001646367,0.016596297,-0.14597818,-0.01039501,0.0344058,0.0033354682,-0.045734078,-0.09473446,0.08810854,-0.06317581,0.09329375,0.0021655513,-0.014223084,0.013959353,-0.03740347,-0.028504917,0.07125937,-0.047800973,-0.11047524,-0.0711086,0.008137937,0.0013272077,0.0028561633,0.056505714,-0.063880846,0.027419578,0.075768776,-0.039874785,0.0016260765,0.042017113,0.033941157,-0.04349125,0.018704768,0.019196402,-0.03435817,-0.00013315068,-0.05500906,-0.048013464,0.016234653,0.04028411,0.03904513,-0.010566999,-0.0017695124,0.07259445,-0.0445609,-0.029761625,0.07399368,0.030214703,0.033479277,0.028748395,0.020292215,-0.004242708,0.05579772,0.0728601,0.014369523,-0.082906894,0.033187006,-0.025067525,0.065725036,-0.048029136,-0.04500873,0.07704271,0.038100656,0.024715088,-0.039182726,0.038818084,0.09065827,0.031383816,-0.094991595,0.050756373,0.1686157,0.0070948494,0.0005457246,0.0029784788,-0.0010677751,0.0002884929,-0.026796944,0.0015869641,0.0029579962,-0.0007045503,0.05944854,0.03380157,0.0016330855,0.07642932,0.03790