1415	11	18	B. Single Controller Operations\nCurrently, in Europe, ATC control centers staff each sector\nwith a team of two human ATCOs (a radar and a planner\nATCO), where the radar ATCO provides precise instructions\nto pilots, while the planner ATCO handles coordination tasks\nsuch as routing changes and coordination with neighboring\nsectors. This way, the team can distribute the workload\nand maintain the declared capacity of each sector. Declared\ncapacity is defined as the number of aircraft per hour that\ncan be handled based on equipment and airspace size, and is\ndetermined through simulations and expert knowledge [20].	Preamble	97	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.04266281,-0.09695097,-0.1889771,0.054071262,-0.0017388716,-0.0022660648,0.020670624,0.00064363267,0.008609777,0.05650565,-0.045242213,0.0025254583,0.0053405203,-0.020888409,-0.026411084,0.054161895,0.024779784,-0.17336921,-0.015421074,-0.029453686,0.047487702,-0.017942468,0.008310437,0.022050038,-0.028621448,-0.007967584,-0.0972209,-0.04520088,-0.0365534,-0.06346758,-0.018179225,0.008771773,0.07993379,0.021124579,-0.01177996,-0.0019561779,0.0157967,0.0051752636,0.025846355,-0.061135918,0.006241294,0.0082172565,-0.014591951,0.01952064,-0.04137423,0.07863858,-0.057846606,0.032830957,-0.05975517,-0.016067745,0.08085209,0.009566841,-0.046385437,-0.026242625,0.00029150373,0.032470107,-0.06891155,-0.019195624,0.004932334,0.023252787,-0.06108266,0.005604337,-0.00083371106,0.0071601607,0.01662784,0.01108426,-0.026050068,0.010637882,-0.06471435,-0.051115938,-0.0034239904,-0.08300444,0.0394683,0.06191474,0.08231506,-0.035886493,-0.0059737056,0.03784692,0.04531353,-0.083045594,0.02406465,0.047200285,-0.06688294,-0.0040420005,-0.008994697,-0.084025145,-0.010474779,0.023626544,0.11574031,-0.0030774896,0.049854893,0.012124278,0.045111023,-0.05261185,-0.06303634,-0.0055022244,0.014598658,0.0036564057,-0.01255536,-0.026715439,0.020151125,-0.008223646,0.09569613,0.007181072,-0.061166044,-0.051629707,0.034164436,-0.0149463685,0.060