1424	11	27	D. Human-AI Teaming in Air Traffic Control\nAs the ODD [6] includes all operating conditions, under\nwhich a given automation system or feature is designed to\nfunction safely, characteristics of human users collaborating\nwith the AI-based system have to be described and considered. Following Cooke, Demir, and Huang [31], Human-\nAutonomy Teaming can be defined as a “socio-technical\nsystem in which at least one human and one autonomous\nsystem interact interdependently over time to complete a\ncommon goal or task”. For the role of humans in Human-\nAutonomy Teaming scenarios, the committee of the National\nAcademies of Sciences, Engineering, and Medicine [32] made\nsubstantial conclusions relevant to ODD requirements.	Preamble	109	3	\N	\N	{}	[0.005388859,-0.018178444,-0.022916835,-0.0055519077,0.010095172,-0.025295876,0.086889975,0.019087408,-0.042837206,0.031681888,-0.026072456,0.0073196525,-0.013532897,0.015589287,0.032470603,-0.022457687,0.035495188,-0.11723221,-0.062450726,0.021686522,-0.026419073,-0.010091232,-0.049315054,0.012255208,-0.065420225,-0.03956078,0.030989414,-0.051302046,-0.038133018,-0.00019234174,0.034521542,-0.020849397,0.10752239,0.025770377,-0.064264596,-0.005325298,0.036985505,0.0030206963,0.016359149,-0.009833044,-0.0559282,-0.12904796,-0.016644496,-0.014707544,-0.028489113,0.08056,-0.095844604,-0.009781566,0.024307204,0.018740406,0.017050287,0.030477632,0.04597485,-0.05231224,0.041302558,0.002176989,-0.0026504414,0.0040936754,-0.026641838,-0.03322132,-0.03351449,0.021634119,0.042355627,0.04009107,0.04004016,0.011778655,0.011182889,-0.030962,0.038342915,-0.031115621,-0.028727332,-0.017520202,-0.021026267,-0.02195085,0.081720605,0.022604948,0.056518704,-0.09970397,0.060280874,-0.08301348,0.0028595296,0.012828033,-0.010056081,0.027633702,-0.009930624,0.006413754,-0.05990797,0.02043562,0.013332688,0.06520337,-0.1146806,-0.0023777313,0.09191524,-0.05177432,0.012977995,0.089031264,0.0027444575,0.050451055,-0.030951327,-0.03414638,0.00