1418	11	21	In light of the demanding nature of the job\nand the strict requirements for candidates, addressing these\nshortages through recruitment alone is challenging, especially\nwith increasing levels of air traffic. While rules do not\nspecifically forbid staffing a sector with a single person, it is\nonly considered when the amount of air traffic is expected to\nbe less than half of the declared capacity.	Preamble	64	2	\N	\N	{}	[0.030332588,-0.046408005,-0.013004774,0.014339461,0.017826512,-0.007058305,0.0030169704,-0.051452745,-0.044828784,-0.04037086,-0.028433109,-0.027530223,0.04309056,-0.0006486126,0.08123929,-0.07077477,0.024261173,-0.112597495,0.009544966,-0.02860679,0.025706647,-0.06372808,-0.062329702,-0.015589171,-0.05536761,-0.10687574,-0.004885503,0.0068155946,0.010103227,-0.022816379,0.0037620193,0.08287037,0.0427847,0.10312371,0.041132275,0.035180695,-0.042539652,0.024844509,-0.01557344,0.041747924,-0.027990047,-0.052823983,-0.07548141,0.041414537,-0.044118024,-0.036720347,-0.01601065,0.020133657,0.018619306,-0.0065073897,0.081385076,0.027682314,0.039898925,0.047097314,0.0069799325,-0.063885875,-0.005437289,-0.0667119,-0.05359235,0.008167138,-0.08912783,-0.023845023,0.0022113437,-0.059122972,0.022122366,-0.034653895,-0.08838725,-0.015664345,-0.023840114,0.03687507,-0.03248257,-0.049344376,-0.044085275,0.09564735,0.06362072,0.0011339352,0.023361191,0.025545735,0.11687907,-0.015998963,0.022352045,-0.07302021,-0.047235955,0.0007157723,-0.073874965,-0.03625792,-0.040614005,-0.086824186,0.0018761663,0.02450093,-0.004996418,0.059794337,0.10411029,0.0028482892,0.03345483,0.022083262,0.036196616,0.059559375,-0.06294401,0.009377799,0.01255945,0.0075674783,0.0779167,0.02329663,-0.17453042,-0.04596839,0.004973265,-0.060055424,-0.005699967,-0.040110372,0.025114711,0.042432856,0.015187755,-0.07063477,-0.023872508,0.039844792,-0.013060269,-0.0196101,-0.078884974,0.0504023,-0.10877,0.00014755053,0.011383684,-0.01295222,0.054001357,-0.031418815,-0.004876553,2.196