1421	11	24	Thus, the question arises of how human-centered integration\nof AI-based systems could consider humans’ expectations\nof their human partners as well as digital partners. The\nsuccess of such a human-human team relies on effective\ncollaboration with shared goals and intentions, as well as the\nhuman’s need to share emotions, experiences, and activities\nwith each other [24]. As human operators need to work\ntogether effectively and cooperatively, communication in\ncontrol operations is of high importance. Workshops with\nexperienced ATCOs, which were conducted to gather their\nexpectations about future tasks, roles, and responsibilities,\nindicated that task allocation, teamwork, and monitoring in a\nhighly automated workplace pose challenges [25], [26].	Preamble	107	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.043131847,0.0007476774,-0.043148715,-0.014262122,-0.06266452,-0.06171645,0.028029624,-0.01575023,0.03789658,-0.012432774,-0.04740877,0.009785189,0.014992051,0.037010115,0.030950109,-0.040741485,0.018985836,-0.11218071,-0.055028327,-0.037132967,-0.026324809,-0.029377125,-0.02561709,0.0012483957,-0.032565296,-0.02511225,0.008467013,-0.11898555,-0.036566183,0.018844098,-0.010465952,-0.07402244,0.16718341,0.018968472,-0.0744856,0.068488754,0.07912757,0.0067589316,0.046043094,-0.13379753,-0.07511342,-0.08247114,0.028399859,0.0038615786,-0.025727611,0.07635585,-0.047867436,-0.057197284,-0.024129225,-0.01830201,-0.11459311,-0.036734916,0.085522495,0.0023671468,0.0007430153,0.05392385,0.01158308,0.016905913,0.050066214,-0.052330323,-0.014548103,-0.032475796,0.00817219,0.0638565,0.0023095417,-0.0022526975,0.009232029,0.040617872,-0.0514279,-0.021058511,-0.0319025,-0.007567143,0.023346264,0.00092042686,0.040163692,0.043343626,-0.033179794,-0.0737048,0.050586604,-0.046842776,0.008434389,0.022270955,0.009710707,0.06205484,-0.056466628,-0.010045395,-0.032966033,0.029150385,0.056178853,-0.007410775,-0.099114224,-0.054355565,-0.008293516,-0.019680979,-0.017560473,0.025091898,0.011288443,0.02