1426	11	29	Secondly, an effective Human-AI team augments human\ncapabilities and raises performance beyond that of either entity. An important point for the design of Human-Autonomy\nTeams in ATC is the need for real-time transparency [32]\nwhich means that human ATCOs must be able to understand\nand predict AI-based systems in the context of their time-\nsensitive, dynamic, and safety-critical work. In doing so, the\ntransparency of the AI-based system involves two interrelated\ncomponents. The display transparency provides a real-time\nunderstanding of the actions of the AI system as a part\nof situation awareness (SA) and explainability provides\ninformation in a backward-looking manner on the logic,\nprocess, and factors, or reasoning upon which the system’s\nactions or recommendations are based.	Preamble	118	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.04038419,-0.057057735,-0.118506126,0.038094617,0.09806693,-0.003560809,0.07337747,-0.017437894,0.061662722,0.040970225,-0.021093622,-0.007323958,-0.0064651775,-0.012681882,0.0008206223,-0.084218666,0.08225673,-0.072569855,-0.055664655,-0.08123288,0.06107376,-0.050719764,-0.021833487,0.028352339,-0.0350627,-0.028978288,0.040507134,-0.08032953,-0.022056455,-0.030437248,0.06951207,-0.09253014,0.13939682,-0.06143997,-0.05844457,0.068433665,0.021484688,0.03094849,0.013260965,-0.06683009,-0.04685932,-0.07026776,-0.0048366594,-0.009551923,0.0073362347,0.09471851,-0.03403684,-0.06281587,-0.0065761195,0.004815766,-0.123238154,-0.05632417,0.0050696526,-0.06773226,-0.05076595,0.055256147,-0.043071423,0.008540499,-0.049432956,0.0058119604,-0.03820534,-0.018344423,0.022587012,0.05909738,0.06747991,0.057126116,0.0138674425,-0.03145907,0.064732276,-0.048561104,0.054406874,0.06734024,0.011218143,-0.09118666,0.0076380554,0.025350798,-0.022321334,-0.0077158753,-0.0012511046,-0.016176587,0.04278417,-0.013615128,-0.012518234,0.05521746,-0.00443616,-0.018008359,-0.023430495,0.016371612,-0.012309595,0.055491325,0.0037739947,-0.021675352,0.08232335,-0.0226732,0.064