1433	11	36	The use case consists of ATC tasks\nin a specified en-route sector. In particular, it is based on SCOs,\nwhere a single human ATCO is responsible for managing all\nthe tasks related to traffic control and acts as a controller-in-\ncharge. In addition, the human ATCO is supported by a digital\nATCO that can perform various traffic control tasks. More\nspecifically, Digital Interactive Reliable Controller (DIRC) [9],\n[10], a digital ATCO is used in this study. In a previous\nwork [11], DIRC was called Digital Control Assistant (DCA).	Preamble	88	5	\N	\N	{}	[-0.16179417,-0.07332889,-0.14454861,-0.011003734,-0.023970615,-0.006147194,0.05359643,0.05000741,-0.007242803,0.0558176,0.0043587615,0.047101516,-0.0029297182,-0.00537472,-0.045554124,-0.00970237,0.1612638,-0.012539617,0.012056756,0.0067037987,0.030783767,0.048753172,-0.05310843,0.024795124,-0.100984305,-0.06823842,-0.009541583,-0.08509403,-0.035105154,-0.053898945,0.01599444,0.048304804,0.055863123,0.01011475,-0.06919078,-0.015503574,0.04230345,-0.0047690202,0.027142761,-0.106006384,-0.009219791,-0.036796656,-0.025330963,-0.016098855,-0.022857755,-0.04795643,-0.03541329,0.014302217,-0.016546488,-0.02298992,0.07286905,0.022432514,0.05072056,0.004667543,-0.06679568,0.05473659,0.050265897,0.0406808,-0.020422032,0.040906277,-0.015378965,-0.0030963907,-0.023883203,0.09417747,0.07061333,-0.013446821,0.023471348,-0.02941016,0.010717757,-0.07146479,0.005396921,-0.03926729,0.0057683517,0.061174266,0.049994744,-0.062485967,-0.021014329,-0.006133608,0.035236537,-0.042608324,0.05236681,0.06512807,-0.060406543,-0.0010041575,0.005156663,0.023996776,-0.039016962,0.03225447,0.061259467,-0.027357476,0.04052955,0.03229059,0.06757195,-0.08400109,-0.048317242,-0.084463775,0.07410247,0.021496058,0.010164898,-0.012850982,0.031974502,0.037653215,-0.030248497,-0.08050652,0.010587105,0.01609755,0.03199947,-0.025869824,0.06834117,0.03910995,-0.070190534,0.0067053703,-0.081468776,-0.05991774,-0.043276306,-0.07283581,-0.033747897