1443	11	46	The creation and optimization are carried out using simulated\nannealing and evolutionary algorithms. It is possible to request\na one-point solution created with simulated annealing or amore sophisticated solution from the evolutionary algorithm\nstarting with the simulated annealing solution. The parameters\nneeded by the evolutionary algorithm such as population size,\nnumber of generations, crossover and mutation probabilities,\netc. can be included in the trajectory generation request\ntogether with a set of optimization criteria with weight factors\nlike trajectory length, similarity to the original trajectory,\nor usage of a route network. The avoidance of conflicts is\nalways included but the importance may be reduced using a\nweight factor.	Preamble	107	4	\N	\N	{}	[0.0076320185,-0.020653104,-0.06059372,-0.001636836,-0.07160638,-0.07204504,-0.022730429,0.008663845,-0.05469908,0.018565012,-0.028837115,-0.029937735,0.08397516,-0.059605096,-0.06823987,0.07587876,-0.019261615,-0.028227549,0.03801447,-0.053264946,0.05373041,-0.014377217,-0.0084499,-0.051528193,-0.13883115,-0.038996775,0.05426982,0.029167699,-0.026786063,-0.013408847,0.11288383,-0.0025883352,0.010211221,-0.015702132,-0.025859222,-0.020668365,-0.16801354,-0.02239418,0.058417927,0.02717193,-0.0008078737,0.021777498,0.07191109,0.013810139,0.059425432,-0.02057607,-0.04940741,0.106920674,-0.019368308,0.009374988,-0.07460947,-0.075634256,-0.0012930871,-0.045697264,0.085137405,0.014533686,-0.031531088,-0.02492489,-0.006031734,-0.025332203,0.069920294,-0.024766859,0.015814282,-0.06259329,0.028110027,-0.034298386,0.012354618,0.0027969172,0.081844375,-0.031819038,-0.021007719,0.04657198,-0.046272907,0.0734141,-0.011674883,0.1035768,0.03697949,0.049227104,-0.05012858,0.009206672,-0.010500793,-0.010913585,-0.00542475,0.0398633,0.017283414,0.0037817028,0.028806426,-0.037790146,0.12848327,0.018720495,0.004657476,0.08043931,0.022581808,-0.042996828,-0.064205684,0.05855696,-0.041319817,-0.05203745,0.07