1446	11	49	TraGAT has its own\nHuman-Machine-Interface showing the actual activity and\nthe best results found so far, but it can be used without it by\nvisualization solution in the radar display.\n3) Simulation Environment: For the first test of the new\napproach to create an ODD for the air traffic domain,\nseveral simulation trials were carried out in the Air Traffic\nManagement and Operations Simulator (ATMOS) at the DLR\nAir Traffic Validation Center [44]. However, the simulations\nwere conducted without integrating real controllers or pseudo-\npilots for carrying out commands given by the controllers. This real-time simulation environment uses NARSIM [45] as a\nbase system and the same input data was used to feed CoDiST. As input data, the complete airspace used by NARSIM was\nintegrated into CoDiST and the same flight plan was used.	Preamble	134	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.056951165,-0.029400453,-0.11076026,-0.07125243,-0.043241475,-0.11396546,-0.0043744147,0.041094728,-0.055070344,0.034976866,0.01858501,-0.0419907,0.014367881,0.0014494137,-0.013425602,-0.051881064,-0.008618316,-0.0820265,0.0117981825,-0.07450862,0.02708395,0.039185014,-0.079295054,-0.03872249,-0.021076884,0.000212341,0.0032434748,-0.014565616,0.061326858,-0.0882172,0.044169497,0.07825605,0.07753085,0.025814155,-0.06251611,-0.060924575,0.018809937,0.023139756,-0.057543986,-0.049833585,-0.0013576838,-0.011125766,0.010615997,0.007494344,-0.025878256,-0.021032607,-0.03728739,0.004001748,0.0022382636,0.04339442,-0.070987925,0.035667405,0.039895196,-7.784375e-05,0.0074384375,0.060764868,-0.059748754,-0.0039579524,-0.0050895275,0.021957176,-0.105824605,0.08245653,0.0051217116,-0.008137986,0.0052656927,-0.031450026,0.020780222,0.031615913,0.12977658,-0.058143087,-0.038760114,-0.0022772497,-0.035438094,-0.032046515,-0.031076403,0.034115087,-0.017072218,-0.045107834,-0.021360489,-0.08991452,0.06940608,0.02238635,-0.01041501,0.05910231,0.025703767,0.016867124,-0.06471975,0.01441118,0.06983856,0.004422305,0.0283954