1447	11	50	This way, the resulting simulation works very similarly to the\nreal-time simulator, but with a single supervisor for assigning\ncommands. This supervisor was responsible for creating the\ndefined conflict situations and evaluating the results of the\nconflict resolution process as shown in Figure 3. Furthermore, CoDiST can cooperate with DIRC, see Sub-\nsection III-A , by receiving adapted trajectories or commands\nlike “start conflict resolution” and sending back information\nabout identified conflicts, conflict resolutions, changed flight\ntrajectories, and other events. Detected conflicts are not\nautomatically solved by CoDiST.	Preamble	88	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.09073445,-0.050295923,-0.053058773,-0.02393994,-0.0132586835,-0.020490566,-0.018922888,-0.004193069,0.007973782,0.07084599,0.03410284,-0.02685444,-0.07001493,-0.0011221984,-0.058988642,-0.009902371,-0.004680127,-0.04449999,-0.04656529,-0.010523378,-0.0100354,0.07268368,-0.011306245,0.024318283,-0.116228856,-0.007081552,0.015322563,-0.0137807485,0.0016731997,-0.06255585,0.07496152,0.07856467,0.05717334,-0.006657711,0.045153163,0.053902753,0.017579833,-0.055694107,-0.03026587,-0.062410407,0.004952646,0.04691725,0.028869689,0.0036915664,-0.0026977414,0.009451221,-0.05328472,0.05342065,-0.045562953,0.0032031846,-0.093281835,0.005362078,-0.004789217,-0.053596802,0.09128323,0.09016328,0.056118257,0.029599136,0.051547088,0.03325259,-0.06697784,0.07792554,-0.044201404,-0.036630154,0.07255802,-0.029072478,0.06116057,0.01588958,0.053226832,-0.021663554,0.032798484,0.03948581,-0.036240805,-0.059303794,0.0030796377,0.03777015,-0.06311381,-0.007143469,0.05251802,-0.07885669,0.006226415,-0.02354377,-0.031187933,0.052110076,0.018594973,-0.06579949,0.02083515,0.025519365,0.14339586,0.04011886,-0.02327388,-0.062416755,0.087895975,-0.0073702824,-0.08787815,0.020368852,0.051579624,0.03273784,0.012163679,0.0012157613,0.003526828,-0.058551192,0.010854441,-0.020063948,0.046224266,0.051662717,0.0055967285,-0.12299607,-0.02