1471	11	74	IV. E XECUTED CONFLICT SCENARIOS\nThe use case of DIRC, the AI-based digital team partner\nfor human ATCOs, was introduced for investigating Human-\nAI Teaming in the safety-critical aviation domain. Special\nfocus was put on the most important task in ATC DIRCs\ncapability of CD&R. For this, the tools TCC for conflict\ndetection and TraGAT for conflict resolution are outlined. The\ngoal of the paper was to develop an initial high-level ODD\nfor the ATC domain in general, with certain low-level details\non CD&R. For this, an ODD definition process was set up,\nconsidering stakeholder requirements for the initial version,\nand subsequent refining of the ODD. Since defining an ODD\nis a complex task, iterations are required.	Preamble	117	5	\N	\N	{}	[-0.07541079,0.022390084,-0.06802073,-0.042900253,0.034107335,-0.011852525,0.055128552,0.03187288,0.027812265,0.08104059,-0.0194342,-0.02202332,-0.007322981,-0.0032961497,0.0054725627,-0.020278797,0.00812196,-0.07286138,-0.040633935,-0.029645009,0.0020064055,0.019363526,-0.04365212,0.011052791,-0.07554478,-0.017340666,0.010923802,-0.027183104,-0.005264385,-0.05349906,0.035898894,0.07323065,0.075546786,0.033242557,0.01536561,0.029809052,-0.0073380643,0.04229544,0.034278583,-0.08424057,-0.080265135,-0.03586606,-0.013175765,-0.028205443,-0.052052934,0.027964097,-0.07711657,0.04360088,-0.019934181,0.06825429,-0.042564776,0.011681796,-0.013768912,-0.033929054,0.04097024,0.021399816,0.03653883,0.03316133,-0.016611414,0.001044061,-0.041154608,0.027372755,-0.050247952,0.033114478,0.04983273,-0.001901603,-0.008850127,0.036545854,0.017035173,0.013589654,0.002075913,0.019040765,0.030875301,0.0135945175,0.07137886,0.095902726,-0.0020296327,0.0089299595,0.03577547,-0.10435151,-0.01765942,-0.004959111,-0.038491767,0.025534725,0.044949364,0.0073059094,-0.01768048,0.049748417,0.057914983,0.06518982,-0.049371485,0.01918383,0.20947845,-0.035459794,0.058313724,0.07121663,0.046661347,0.04321968,0.037897028,-0.0047164797,0.03445432,-