1481	11	84	V. C ONCLUSION AND OUTLOOK\nAssuring safety in future Human-AI Teaming confronts\nengineers with an added layer of complexity, due to the black-\nbox behavior of AI-based systems. In this paper, the concept\nof Operational Design Domains (ODDs) was transferred from\nthe automotive field into the air traffic control domain as a\npotential way towards safety assurance in such teams.	Preamble	60	2	\N	\N	{}	[-0.011200889,0.018624075,-0.035085723,0.0019236795,0.047304295,-0.05352061,0.034857623,0.08162787,0.0108082825,0.009975673,-0.0762868,-0.038722053,0.050507195,-0.015504654,-0.021515055,-0.01198938,0.06792298,-0.047126144,-0.051706117,-0.0024771034,0.019080017,0.0150957545,-0.022368316,-0.03076068,-0.10378879,-0.02650626,-0.002891177,-0.0033386634,-0.025833733,-0.07664974,-0.007451742,-0.02168033,0.073155105,-0.016763793,0.0098864185,0.025537748,-0.045298774,-0.009506569,0.01591676,-0.032166217,-0.13336049,-0.09723823,-0.001988836,0.01956665,0.013409128,0.036798302,-0.00946957,-0.031308826,0.049501315,0.0010713508,-0.02385645,0.007869418,0.02473309,-0.07003135,0.009720384,0.049873892,0.005148504,-0.0013364173,-0.038583256,-0.021474458,0.0068851314,0.01438393,0.003940319,0.027248615,-0.015516381,0.06580875,0.0039716493,0.031265225,0.021346722,0.0098582655,0.023751661,0.013943332,0.013216425,-0.0067134383,0.13602228,0.09157522,-4.182261e-05,-0.059382547,0.029671641,-0.050286375,0.04394284,-0.041182473,-0.0365534,0.05893588,-0.021302555,0.022159878,-0.059128355,-0.005286387,0.0982262,0.08210592,-0.09854611,-0.021876229,0.11602493,0.0069774184,0.105002925,0.049150616,-0.044107053,-0.009967184,-0.03731574,-0.004841403,-0.012325808,-0.0114784,0.05829335,0.038923424,-0.043919876,0.02393894,0.055023592,-0.024099618,0.01059676,-0.062016167,0.06806237,0.007960639,0.08323489,-0.0982196,-0.053322766,-0.0028307482,-0.13920663,0.048678327,0.009734695,-0.0075285896,-0.0033374853,-0.0017876833,0.057592984,0.06060075,0.06492104,-0.054208953,0.020513313,-1.9737928e-33,-0.09