1484	11	87	For example, it\nwas found that DIRC may successfully avoid a conflict, but in\ncases when the aircraft is close to the boundary of the sector,\neventually sends the aircraft into an unplanned neighboring\nsector. Of course, ongoing development will increase the\nperformance of such systems, but this does not change thefact, that a safety layer in the form of an ODD, monitoring\nthe system will be required. However, the transfer of ODD from automotive to air\ntraffic control required some adjustments. Compared to the\nautomotive ODD, the ATC ODD does not operate from an ego\nvehicle perspective, but from a bird’s eye view.	Preamble	104	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.061429393,-0.08012055,-0.051399373,0.037294295,0.11614117,-0.029550187,0.02474981,0.022436893,0.0015199332,0.064177915,0.057097964,0.07396206,-0.021609716,-0.06362914,-0.050235998,-0.006928526,0.1053604,-0.112603866,-0.01655905,0.022261772,-0.04324956,0.017228406,0.015570512,0.031094799,-0.107944936,-0.04422067,-0.029329056,0.012388867,-0.02844105,-0.1367076,0.0040980526,0.05523859,-0.009958506,0.008337764,-0.03905568,-0.07251404,0.026446696,0.06820367,0.040529452,-0.09970849,-0.012104748,-0.07753742,-0.013230222,-0.02861654,-0.09691077,-0.015309567,-0.029177846,0.018884253,0.0133600375,-0.056953486,-0.01335073,0.0014813703,-0.0430742,-0.025396183,-0.02512559,0.086427696,5.622515e-05,0.06328142,-0.06852819,0.014440465,-0.029330758,0.049193136,-0.05853536,-0.020467557,0.049806315,2.7041206e-05,0.004754074,-0.016380267,-0.0077405944,-0.001381728,0.028862517,-0.008248793,0.011776093,0.002415619,0.15676668,-0.008635139,-0.036134094,0.034879994,0.019595014,-0.04095946,-0.027117064,-0.026075449,-0.050834004,-0.013449573,0.033679243,-0.032286346,-0.056329105,0.011875618,0.04454093,0.07427806,-0.044730235,-0.010747092,0.1093009,-0.1061315,0.11062499,0.060404904,0.053199597,-0.0058406624,0.01836721,-0.022660257,0.09426815,0.0131972125,-0.059530355,0.008009342,0.022818582,0.07088697,0.011632006,-0.09617128,0.042238027,