1486	11	89	Therefore, future investigations will include ODD management\nwithin the whole system of Human-AI Teaming to develop\nsolutions on EASA level 2 applications. As a part of that,\nfindings from Human-Autonomy Teaming studies, to mitigate\nthe negative consequences of highly automated systems, need\nto be considered for future advancements. Furthermore, the\ninterface between ATCO’s current task load and ODDs for\nidentifying suitable conditions for dynamic task allocation\nwill be an important factor for the success of safe Human-\nAI Teaming in the field of AI-based Air Traffic Controller\nOperations.	Preamble	88	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.028668385,-0.032567475,-0.077845395,0.029929398,0.054225493,-0.0238007,0.08387354,0.019571835,-0.01768656,0.07105851,-0.03380878,0.0029396117,-0.010056642,0.013228353,0.0086235795,-0.00852864,0.07132933,-0.09521538,-0.025438184,-0.016576158,0.013691319,-0.05641022,-0.038461745,0.013995589,-0.058768936,-0.055899356,-0.019762633,-0.055098623,-0.030284608,-0.05945255,0.03164108,-0.04801276,0.100085855,0.0034364874,-0.03209657,-0.018798891,-0.02269346,-0.03227802,0.048544385,-0.043035984,-0.04882693,-0.099972054,-0.039997432,-0.015623755,-0.020249402,0.08053339,-0.077754565,-0.017393138,0.026330043,0.016613634,0.06844477,0.0056808167,0.048163194,-0.061542563,-0.00949214,0.035774935,-0.011230537,-0.020316528,-0.042482603,0.0071789664,-0.045272917,0.009629739,0.006525518,0.0032989096,-0.021607662,0.0057082586,0.019483129,-0.025790075,0.016049763,-0.0010293119,-0.0065939855,0.0027248922,0.016825087,-0.044968516,0.12513275,0.064548396,0.057898123,-0.07497655,0.0432324,-0.055058137,0.028560141,-0.029084887,-0.02840341,0.044034936,-0.003909179,0.00809168,-0.045611154,-0.018960804,0.04381812,0.051399533,-0.06630516,-0.015069356,0.12054179,0.004343735,0.07241972,0.055748377,0.017391393,0.042517442,-0.057525255,-0.03572289,0.0014326099,0.0052821185,0.040150966,-0.019563168,-0.01604168,0.0350253,0.07687721,-0.10363908,0.09500907,-0.03998271,0.018