1497	12	10	As part of autonomous system capabilities, we consider adaptation as a key capabil ity and\nwe make a connection to adaptation of model -based solutions. We argue that reaching higher and wider\nlevels of autonomy requires a rethink of the design processes for both the physical plants as well as the way\nautomation, control, and safety solut ions are conceptualised. Keywords : Autonomous systems, process automation, process control, machine learning, artificial\nintelligence, unmanned operation, fault detection, supervis ory control , functional safety , human -machine\ninterface, process monitoring, performance optimization\n1.	Preamble	91	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.017699005,-0.045456935,0.015321771,-0.03165175,0.07528255,-0.053263366,0.03928429,0.08657408,-0.07770815,0.08348775,0.020841235,-0.017660966,0.09025169,0.014677305,-0.022490088,-0.07392076,0.049576096,-0.021868387,-0.08355826,-0.030666456,0.019047517,0.049187277,-0.02537439,0.058305643,-0.095971406,0.034837924,-0.0035453571,0.019410526,-0.055013426,-0.10934575,-0.015001169,-0.0017217282,0.07400781,-0.06427403,-0.0022824474,0.03359598,0.03246045,-0.043081637,0.025744585,-0.07971329,-0.032369524,-0.06484837,-0.028622894,-0.001046339,0.012943536,0.08068945,-0.04258882,-0.15574521,0.017219393,-0.018577864,-0.06578956,-0.012838639,0.010876473,-0.0767138,0.0059596854,0.01625317,0.07222212,-0.0076404065,0.037073813,-0.0383305,0.032863308,0.0055775284,-0.026647462,0.047385585,0.0024200303,0.00015480338,-0.06340537,0.018724926,0.038130444,-0.047651693,-0.01968337,0.0006467502,0.013400593,-0.009709701,0.003814395,-0.059755687,0.008414729,-0.01670516,0.033230048,-0.009930598,-0.02315415,0.013641084,-0.07217232,0.0915431,0.037001427,-0.012258878,-0.051047646,0.025104607,0.09725504,-0.058659337,0.0025082415,-0.021163244,0.06698632,-0.025338883,0.023537317,0.06260934,0.031328037,-0.09195959,-0.00082037516,0.002451468,-0.008134459,-0.009666026,-0.03544733,0.008370625,0.089957245,0.005153593,0.019641144,0.0049329903,0.0