1521	12	34	As part of autonomous system capabilities, we consider adaptation as a key capabil ity and\nwe make a connection to adaptation of model -based solutions. We argue that reaching higher and wider\nlevels of autonomy requires a rethink of the design processes for both the physical plants as well as the way\nautomation, control, and safety solut ions are conceptualised. Keywords : Autonomous systems, process automation, process control, machine learning, artificial\nintelligence, unmanned operation, fault detection, supervis ory control , functional safety , human -machine\ninterface, process monitoring, performance optimization\n1.	Preamble	91	3	\N	\N	{}	[-0.017699007,-0.04545691,0.015321787,-0.031651746,0.07528258,-0.053263385,0.039284304,0.086574055,-0.07770815,0.083487734,0.02084124,-0.017660977,0.09025168,0.014677301,-0.022490073,-0.073920734,0.049576066,-0.021868408,-0.08355825,-0.030666443,0.019047543,0.04918727,-0.025374329,0.058305636,-0.095971376,0.03483794,-0.0035453655,0.019410498,-0.055013426,-0.10934574,-0.015001158,-0.0017217156,0.0740078,-0.064274006,-0.0022824558,0.03359598,0.032460466,-0.043081608,0.02574459,-0.07971326,-0.032369513,-0.064848356,-0.02862291,-0.0010463446,0.012943503,0.08068943,-0.04258882,-0.1557452,0.0172194,-0.018577823,-0.06578954,-0.012838641,0.010876452,-0.076713786,0.005959651,0.016253185,0.07222212,-0.0076403767,0.037073806,-0.038330477,0.032863315,0.0055775177,-0.026647419,0.047385577,0.002420027,0.00015478847,-0.06340536,0.018724952,0.038130414,-0.04765167,-0.019683378,0.00064674125,0.013400567,-0.009709696,0.003814388,-0.05975568,0.008414696,-0.01670518,0.03323005,-0.00993056,-0.023154154,0.013641081,-0.072172366,0.09154304,0.03700142,-0.012258899,-0.051047668,0.025104571,0.09725504,-0.058659334,0.00250824,-0.021163257,0.06698634,-0.025338808,0.02353731,0.06260934,0.031328045,-0.09195956,-0.0008203915,0.002451484,-0.008134425,-0.009666007,-0.03544733,0.008370598,0.08995721,0.0051536076,0.019641126,0.0049329777,0.06