1552	12	65	In case the\noperators cannot regain control of the plant, safety systems\nensure automatic safe shutdown of the process operation. Operators , plant engineers , and managers are also required to\noptimi se operational decisions . Some plants employ tools such\nas real time optimi sers (RTO) , which could automate the\noptimi sation tasks with the operators and engineers monitoring\nand supervising the performance of these solutions (Müller et\nal., 2017) . Planning and scheduling of process plant operations\nare determined by human dispatchers with help of specialis ed\nsoftware tools to varying degrees . Other cognitive aspects such\nas the management of financial operations rely on human\ncognition.	876 Francesco Borghesan et al. / IF AC PapersOnLine 55-7 (2022) 875–882	110	5	\N	\N	{}	[-0.037298325,0.031884607,-0.07662111,0.020592159,-0.06016702,-0.052990388,0.07148158,0.074600495,-0.0009812282,0.09454653,-0.00037132492,0.053817883,-0.06881211,0.023914486,-0.037407566,-0.08349046,0.014955401,-0.04453908,-0.07933036,-0.09461912,0.06339843,-0.04581919,-0.086952634,-0.025074791,-0.04130456,-0.02471933,-0.06047013,0.014992854,0.0501214,0.015958097,-0.0052540903,-0.020393312,0.108030446,-0.049411085,-0.013895804,0.111608416,-0.01915121,-0.01595121,0.044924024,-0.06826362,-0.099574804,-0.098401785,-0.04791579,-0.029867355,-0.032930214,0.025078462,-0.047814477,-0.06051941,0.006825813,-0.07413431,-0.15314406,0.031160472,0.03300253,-0.05160701,0.0123745175,0.08820751,0.118976556,-0.012219702,0.0282049,-0.018228227,-0.08988602,-0.041479446,-0.0019701463,0.010758235,0.012957098,0.048277006,-0.05136058,-0.044653095,0.046544775,-0.02180732,0.0080649685,0.000979911,-0.07189007,0.018221375,-0.0037065514,0.053252663,-0.006291799,-0.005066804,-0.013509574,-0.06447739,0.06659915,0.03621584,-0.040859144,0.042805385,-0.0022486986,0.03880309,0.0017277946,0.048261255,0.17788596,0.055459816,0.04133771,-0.025054744,0.028764471,-0.03701667,-0.015445429,0.024498643,0.0027961787