1603	12	116	Process monitoring\nand diagnosis solutions are successfully used today in the\nprocess and energy industries as a decision -aid tool ( Qin,\n2012 ). Automati on of the cognitive tasks using such tools will\nclose the loop over operational and possibly also maintenance\nand\ncontinuous improvement related actions. Autonomous\nsystems relying on reinforcement learning for decision -\nmaking tasks would also have to utilise process data directly\nor indirectly (via a process model) to both impro ve their\nperformance and to adapt to changing conditions. Data-driven\nsolutions such as algorithms for generating forecast s for\nvarious external factors , can also be integrated to autonomous\nsolutions and be used to facilitate adaptation processes .	3.5 Auton omy and adaptation	114	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.092489995,0.021109305,-0.010178755,0.02171809,0.03994937,-0.06823994,0.0739946,0.045781687,-0.044560663,0.08524312,-0.048511602,-0.05775018,0.04062303,0.043859463,-0.05021204,-7.537823e-05,0.014355447,-0.06065073,-0.036836356,-0.09636241,0.010869644,0.009707578,-0.02068424,0.06805547,-0.035533015,0.10355729,0.024745293,0.014780423,-0.006608634,-0.026508283,-0.019128587,-0.013710917,0.039502706,-0.042242114,-0.020119928,0.018496156,-0.033524442,0.048737567,-0.036420092,-0.0773211,0.015408553,-0.046049543,-0.010353433,-0.023395747,0.024443261,0.018019276,-0.06299037,-0.11680909,-0.041089457,-0.026281945,-0.10993952,-0.011731558,0.068047576,-0.04194796,0.049063627,0.07390779,0.057092495,-0.030431364,-0.033769254,-0.017448109,-0.0035054716,-0.07978991,-0.048329964,-0.020880595,-0.039517794,0.07145308,-0.065923735,0.04209912,-0.012917381,-0.04573461,-0.07936703,0.094042405,-0.015081159,-0.05364823,0.0029713179,-0.00023842974,-0.012508016,-0.053810783,0.05023311,-0.05027333,-0.039791588,0.046052445,-0.03866153,0.03610562,0.07647771,0.022356946,0.029966556,0.04016776,0.085705824,-0.027883343,0.014143578,-0.04114149,-0.015692102,-0.023524042,-0.03532079,0.046268404,-0.001140