1614	12	127	Process monitoring\nand diagnosis solutions are successfully used today in the\nprocess and energy industries as a decision -aid tool ( Qin,\n2012 ). Automati on of the cognitive tasks using such tools will\nclose the loop over operational and possibly also maintenance\nand continuous improvement related actions. Autonomous\nsystems relying on reinforcement learning for decision -\nmaking tasks would also have to utilise process data directly\nor indirectly (via a process model) to both impro ve their\nperformance and to adapt to changing conditions. Data-driven\nsolutions such as algorithms for generating forecast s for\nvarious external factors , can also be integrated to autonomous\nsolutions and be used to facilitate adaptation processes .	3.5 Auton omy and adaptation	114	4	\N	\N	{}	[-0.09248998,0.021109253,-0.010178773,0.021718105,0.039949387,-0.06823996,0.07399462,0.04578169,-0.04456068,0.08524311,-0.04851159,-0.05775018,0.04062305,0.043859437,-0.050212048,-7.537812e-05,0.014355464,-0.060650744,-0.036836337,-0.09636243,0.010869623,0.009707571,-0.020684252,0.068055436,-0.035533004,0.10355729,0.024745308,0.014780439,-0.0066086827,-0.026508274,-0.019128568,-0.013710926,0.039502688,-0.042242102,-0.020119919,0.018496135,-0.033524446,0.04873759,-0.036420103,-0.0773211,0.015408584,-0.046049524,-0.010353443,-0.02339579,0.024443245,0.018019257,-0.06299035,-0.11680906,-0.04108949,-0.026281925,-0.10993956,-0.011731599,0.0680476,-0.04194793,0.049063623,0.073907785,0.05709247,-0.030431353,-0.03376928,-0.017448109,-0.003505452,-0.07978989,-0.04832996,-0.020880595,-0.039517805,0.071453094,-0.06592373,0.04209913,-0.012917375,-0.04573463,-0.07936704,0.094042435,-0.015081186,-0.053648204,0.0029712901,-0.00023842286,-0.012508005,-0.053810783,0.05023315,-0.0502733,-0.039791603,0.04605245,-0.03866151,0.036105633,0.07647772,0.02235698,0.029966567,0.04016776,0.08570581,-0.02788332,0.014143594,-0.041141484,-0.01569212,-0.023524022,-0.035320792,0.04626838,-0.001140695,-0.0